and watch the scene unfold.", "tokens": [51317, 865, 11, 291, 445, 1394, 646, 293, 1159, 264, 4145, 17980, 13, 51456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12319981561948175, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 1.0119785868664688e-12}, {"id": 7, "seek": 0, "start": 22.12, "end": 25.3, "text": " It's, well, it's an incredibly comforting way to view our own minds.", "tokens": [51471, 467, 311, 11, 731, 11, 309, 311, 364, 6252, 38439, 636, 281, 1910, 527, 1065, 9634, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12319981561948175, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 1.0119785868664688e-12}, {"id": 8, "seek": 0, "start": 25.38, "end": 25.98, "text": " It really is.", "tokens": [51634, 467, 534, 307, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12319981561948175, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 1.0119785868664688e-12}, {"id": 9, "seek": 0, "start": 26.32, "end": 29.3, "text": " We want things to be perfectly stored and perfectly retrievable.", "tokens": [51681, 492, 528, 721, 281, 312, 6239, 12187, 293, 6239, 19817, 17915, 13, 51830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12319981561948175, "compression_ratio": 1.6140350877192982, "no_speech_prob": 1.0119785868664688e-12}, {"id": 10, "seek": 2930, "start": 29.3, "end": 38.54, "text": " Right, we want to believe our brains operate like high-end hard drives, you know, maintaining this totally objective record of who we are and what we've experienced.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 11, 321, 528, 281, 1697, 527, 15442, 9651, 411, 1090, 12, 521, 1152, 11754, 11, 291, 458, 11, 14916, 341, 3879, 10024, 2136, 295, 567, 321, 366, 293, 437, 321, 600, 6751, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05080335949539044, "compression_ratio": 1.6209150326797386, "no_speech_prob": 8.758198701865061e-13}, {"id": 11, "seek": 2930, "start": 38.72, "end": 48.78, "text": " But the moment you step into the actual biological reality of how living systems inter