ver happened", "tokens": [50365, 767, 914, 337, 264, 5221, 775, 341, 914, 321, 362, 281, 2837, 3736, 1203, 300, 575, 1562, 2011, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05778400185181923, "compression_ratio": 1.8028673835125448, "no_speech_prob": 3.0616338457523096e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 129288, "start": 1297.3600000000001, "end": 1303.3600000000001, "text": " to a system because if i have to track every single keystroke of that chaotic weekend rewrite just to", "tokens": [50589, 281, 257, 1185, 570, 498, 741, 362, 281, 2837, 633, 2167, 2141, 42706, 295, 300, 27013, 6711, 28132, 445, 281, 50889], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05778400185181923, "compression_ratio": 1.8028673835125448, "no_speech_prob": 3.0616338457523096e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 129288, "start": 1303.3600000000001, "end": 1308.96, "text": " understand my software's future that sounds completely impossible the data storage alone would be infinite", "tokens": [50889, 1223, 452, 4722, 311, 2027, 300, 3263, 2584, 6243, 264, 1412, 6725, 3312, 576, 312, 13785, 51169], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05778400185181923, "compression_ratio": 1.8028673835125448, "no_speech_prob": 3.0616338457523096e-12}, {"id": 222, "seek": 129288, "start": 1308.96, "end": 1314.64, "text": " it generally is impossible which is why mathematicians introduce the concept of a sufficient statistic", "tokens": [51169, 309, 5101, 307, 6243, 597, 307, 983, 32811, 2567, 5366, 264, 3410, 295, 257, 11563, 29588, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05778400185181923, "compression_ratio": 1.8028673835125448, "no_speech_prob": 3.0616338457523096e-12}, {"id": 223, "seek": 129288, "start": 1314.64, "end": 1320.0, "text": " sufficient statistic sometimes you don't need the whole exhaustive history you just need", "tokens": [51453, 11563, 29588, 2171, 291, 500, 380, 643, 264, 1379, 14687, 488, 2503, 291, 445, 643, 51721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05778400185181923, "compression_ratio": 1.802867383