ic volume of all the exact physical states i could", "tokens": [51037, 256, 3949, 666, 264, 2027, 437, 307, 264, 33246, 5523, 295, 439, 264, 1900, 4001, 4368, 741, 727, 51341], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.03522415620734893, "compression_ratio": 1.8714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 2.7611793060322576e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 162448, "start": 1644.0, "end": 1652.0, "text": " possibly be in we measure a space of endpoints a physical area not a space of infinite paths and this", "tokens": [51341, 6264, 312, 294, 321, 3481, 257, 1901, 295, 917, 20552, 257, 4001, 1859, 406, 257, 1901, 295, 13785, 14518, 293, 341, 51741], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.03522415620734893, "compression_ratio": 1.8714285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 2.7611793060322576e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 165200, "start": 1652.0, "end": 1657.6, "text": " leads to a mind-bending counter example in the text that really challenged my intuition the discrete", "tokens": [50365, 6689, 281, 257, 1575, 12, 65, 2029, 5682, 1365, 294, 264, 2487, 300, 534, 17737, 452, 24002, 264, 27706, 50645], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05503402085139834, "compression_ratio": 1.9047619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 2.193178581452737e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 165200, "start": 1657.6, "end": 1662.96, "text": " system yeah because you would normally think that as time goes on your volume of futures always expands", "tokens": [50645, 1185, 1338, 570, 291, 576, 5646, 519, 300, 382, 565, 1709, 322, 428, 5523, 295, 26071, 1009, 33706, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05503402085139834, "compression_ratio": 1.9047619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 2.193178581452737e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 165200, "start": 1662.96, "end": 1668.72, "text": " more time equals more room to make decisions right it's the intuition yeah but the text shows a three", "tokens": [50913, 544, 565, 6915, 544, 1808, 281, 652, 5327, 558, 309, 311, 264, 24002, 1338, 457, 264, 2487, 3110, 257, 1045, 51201], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_l