e, y no logran detectar esa ca\u00edda invisible de coherencia en los datos milisegundos antes del tropiezo f\u00edsico real, Se acaba la teor\u00eda. S\u00ed, entonces toda la estructura te\u00f3lica del amplitudist y los osciladores se desploma y es falsa. Pone su propia existencia y todo este documento monumental en la l\u00ednea de fuego. Esa honestidad intelectual me parece brutal y refrescante. Y es el broche de oro perfecto para recapitular el inmenso terreno conceptual que hemos cruzado hoy. Porque vaya que fue un viaje. Vaya que s\u00ed. Empezamos desenterrando los f\u00f3siles del c\u00f3digo en lenguajes como C++, sistemas que est\u00e1n literalmente atrapados por el miedo a borrar su propia historia. Luego analizamos c\u00f3mo el cerebro humano de los ajedrecistas y los mec\u00e1nicos comprime los errores del pasado para tomar decisiones casi instant\u00e1neas, volvi\u00e9ndose rapid\u00edsimos pero peligrosamente fr\u00e1giles si las reglas del entorno cambian. El experto fr\u00e1gil. S\u00ed. Exploramos tambi\u00e9n la gesti\u00f3n del futuro y c\u00f3mo, al podar la informaci\u00f3n equivocada, al comprimir mal la maleta, generamos d\u00e9ficits ontol\u00f3gicos tan graves que hunden experimentos cient\u00edficos enteros o dejan peatones virtuales atrapados en sem\u00e1foros ciegos. As\u00ed es. Desenmascaramos la ilusi\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica y burocr\u00e1tica de creer que tener 100 inspectores id\u00e9nticos evaluando un puente nos hace 100 veces m\u00e1s seguros. Y, finalmente, demostramos que algo tan mundano, tan tangible como caminar sobre dos piernas sin caernos, obedece exactamente al mismo principio. Somos historias regener\u00e1ndose en movimiento. Y el hilo conductor en todos estos textos es innegable. Ya sea en la arquitectura base de un software, en la sinapsis del aprendizaje humano profundo, o en la biomec\u00e1nica de evitar una ca\u00edda en la calle, el universo entero opera de forma mucho m\u00e1s robusta y elegante cuando logramos soltar la necesidad humana de fotografiar estados fijos y abrazamos la fluidez de las continuaciones y trayectorias. Totalmente. La realidad, digamos en su forma m\u00e1s pura y natural, no es un estante lleno de cajas etiquetadas est\u00e1ticas. Es un cauce fluido de futuros posibles. Y justo antes de despedirnos de esta inmersi\u00f3n profunda, nos gustar\u00eda dejar sobre la mesa un pensamiento final para ustedes, basado en todo este intrincado mecanismo de compresi\u00f3n y memoria que describi\u00f3 Flaicci\u00f3n, pero enfocado hacia adentro, hacia la vida cotidiana y emocional. Cuando la mente humana entierra o, digamos, olvida ciertos detalles agudos de un trauma del pasado o difumina los recuerdos de una relaci\u00f3n o un proyecto que fracas\u00f3, solemos pensar en ello como un error, \u00bfno? Como una aver\u00eda en nuestro disco duro emocional. Claro, pensamos que la memoria nos falla. Pero bajo esta \u00f3ptica geom\u00e9trica de los documentos de hoy, \u00bfqu\u00e9 tal si no es un fallo en lo absoluto? \u00bfQu\u00e9 tal si es una compresi\u00f3n \u00f3ptima? Un mecanismo brillantemente dise\u00f1ado por nuestra biolog\u00eda para desechar la entrop\u00eda de reparaci\u00f3n y preparar la mente, optimiz\u00e1ndola para los futuros espec\u00edficos que el cerebro cree que va a enfrentar ma\u00f1ana. Uf, es una reflexi\u00f3n poderos\u00edsima. Y te digo, la sombra que persigue a esa misma idea es inevitable. Si nuestra memoria est\u00e1 altamente comprimida solo para sobrevivir a un futuro proyectado que esperamos, \u00bfqu\u00e9 nos sucede como individuos en el instante en que el futuro que finalmente llega a nuestra puerta es radicalmente distinto al que esper\u00e1bamos? \u00a1Wow! \u00a1Claro! Si cambian de pronto las reglas no escritas de nuestro entorno afectivo o laboral sin previo aviso, \u00bfseremos capaces de descomprimir los matices de nuestro propio pasado para adaptarnos o nos quebraremos emocionalmente como el experto fr\u00e1gil que olvid\u00f3 los pasos intermedios de su propia vida? Es fuerte. Y la verdad, no tenemos la respuesta, pero creo firmemente que es la pregunta que debemos mantener encendida al observar nuestros propios sistemas. Porque tal vez no somos esa fotograf\u00eda n\u00edtida y est\u00e1tica que muestra exactamente d\u00f3nde se rompi\u00f3 la pieza, y ya. Tal vez somos, en todo nuestro esplendor ca\u00fatico, la historia invisible, persistente y continua de c\u00f3mo esa pieza est\u00e1 intentando curarse hacia el futuro. Hasta la pr\u00f3xima y sigan cuestionando la fotograf\u00eda.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 9.52, "text": " Imaginemos por un momento que el software de un sem\u00e1foro inteligente, de esos modernos, decide borrar un solo segundo de su memoria.", "tokens": [50365, 34223, 259, 4485, 1515, 517, 9333, 631, 806, 4722, 368, 517, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 44300, 1576, 11, 368, 22411, 4363, 329, 11, 4536, 14828, 5352, 517, 6944, 17954, 368, 459, 1334, 8172, 13, 50841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09060216561341897, "compression_ratio": 1.4102564102564104, "no_speech_prob": 3.559183546844591e-12}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 10.120000000000001, "end": 16.22, "text": " Y como resultado directo de ese peque\u00f1o olvido, un peat\u00f3n se queda esperando en la acera para siempre.", "tokens": [50871, 398, 2617, 28047, 2047, 78, 368, 10167, 38181, 43851, 2925, 11, 517, 520, 267, 1801, 369, 23314, 46587, 465, 635, 696, 1663, 1690, 12758, 13, 51176], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09060216561341897, "compression_ratio": 1.4102564102564104, "no_speech_prob": 3.559183546844591e-12}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 16.92, "end": 19.72, "text": " \u00a1Wow! \u00a1Qu\u00e9 imagen tan frustrante!", "tokens": [51211, 6514, 14076, 0, 6514, 15137, 40652, 7603, 7454, 81, 2879, 0, 51351], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09060216561341897, "compression_ratio": 1.4102564102564104, "no_speech_prob": 3.559183546844591e-12}, {"id": 3, "seek": 1972, "start": 19.72, "end": 38.16, "text": " O pensamos en un maestro internacional de ajedrez, o sea, alguien capaz de anticipar, no s\u00e9, 20 movimientos, y de repente pierde absolutamente todas sus habilidades y juega como un principiante solo porque alguien movi\u00f3 una sola pieza, digamos un cent\u00edmetro fuera de su lugar habitual.", "tokens": [50365, 422, 6099, 2151, 465, 517, 463, 32389, 37382, 368, 17680, 292, 17693, 11, 277, 4158, 11, 25814, 35453, 368, 10416, 289, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 945, 2402, 34841, 11, 288, 368, 42884, 9766, 1479, 49285, 10906, 3291, 36565, 10284, 288, 27833, 3680, 2617, 517, 6959, 72, 2879, 6944, 4021, 25814, 2402, 7138, 2002, 34162, 1730, 2394, 11, 36430, 517, 1489, 870, 45400, 24818, 368, 459, 11467, 46883, 13, 51287], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06872544008142809, "compression_ratio": 1.4885844748858448, "no_speech_prob": 3.531928655792216e-12}, {"id": 4, "seek": 1972, "start": 38.92, "end": 41.32, "text": " S\u00ed, es un colapso total del sistema.", "tokens": [51325, 12375, 11, 785, 517, 1173, 569, 539, 3217, 1103, 13245, 13, 51445], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06872544008142809, "compression_ratio": 1.4885844748858448, "no_speech_prob": 3.531928655792216e-12}, {"id": 5, "seek": 4132, "start": 41.32, "end": 50.32, "text": " Exacto. Por lo general, cuando intentamos entender sistemas complejos, ya sea en la tecnolog\u00eda o en la propia mente humana, buscamos una fotograf\u00eda, \u00bfverdad?", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 5269, 450, 2674, 11, 7767, 8446, 2151, 20054, 48720, 44424, 19136, 11, 2478, 4158, 465, 635, 48055, 277, 465, 635, 40464, 26577, 1952, 64, 11, 1255, 66, 2151, 2002, 34341, 2686, 11, 3841, 331, 20034, 30, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06450684865315755, "compression_ratio": 1.5640138408304498, "no_speech_prob": 6.100030636863041e-12}, {"id": 6, "seek": 4132, "start": 50.74, "end": 58.46, "text": " Queremos, pues, una imagen est\u00e1tica. Si algo se rompe, vamos y buscamos la pieza exacta que fall\u00f3 en ese instante preciso.", "tokens": [50836, 2326, 19065, 11, 11059, 11, 2002, 40652, 3192, 83, 2262, 13, 4909, 8655, 369, 7438, 494, 11, 5295, 288, 1255, 66, 2151, 635, 1730, 2394, 1900, 64, 631, 2100, 812, 465, 10167, 1058, 2879, 30109, 13, 51222], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06450684865315755, "compression_ratio": 1.5640138408304498, "no_speech_prob": 6.100030636863041e-12}, {"id": 7, "seek": 4132, "start": 58.46, "end": 69.7, "text": " Y a ver, es una tendencia muy humana. Nos resulta profundamente reconfortante poder se\u00f1alar un sistema, detenerlo en el tiempo y decir, ah, este es su estado actual.", "tokens": [51222, 398, 257, 1306, 11, 785, 2002, 3928, 10974, 5323, 1952, 64, 13, 18749, 1874, 64, 40958, 3439, 9993, 2728, 2879, 8152, 13830, 12031, 517, 13245, 11, 1141, 7971, 752, 465, 806, 11772, 288, 10235, 11, 3716, 11, 4065, 785, 459, 18372, 3539, 13, 51784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06450684865315755, "compression_ratio": 1.5640138408304498, "no_speech_prob": 6.100030636863041e-12}, {"id": 8, "seek": 6970, "start": 69.7, "end": 71.96000000000001, "text": " Nos da una falsa ilusi\u00f3n de control.", "tokens": [50365, 18749, 1120, 2002, 16720, 64, 1930, 301, 2560, 368, 1969, 13, 50478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05514457536780316, "compression_ratio": 1.5464285714285715, "no_speech_prob": 7.774890106726495e-12}, {"id": 9, "seek": 6970, "start": 72.5, "end": 82.54, "text": " Totalmente. Pero al adentrarnos en los documentos que tenemos hoy sobre la mesa para esta exploraci\u00f3n, esa c\u00e1mara fotogr\u00e1fica se hace a\u00f1istas por completo.", "tokens": [50505, 23170, 4082, 13, 9377, 419, 614, 317, 81, 24979, 465, 1750, 4166, 329, 631, 9914, 13775, 5473, 635, 37024, 1690, 5283, 24765, 3482, 11, 11342, 44273, 15418, 47810, 23858, 64, 369, 10032, 37837, 14858, 1515, 40135, 13, 51007], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05514457536780316, "compression_ratio": 1.5464285714285715, "no_speech_prob": 7.774890106726495e-12}, {"id": 10, "seek": 6970, "start": 83.38, "end": 96.16, "text": " Hoy vamos a analizar por qu\u00e9 nuestra obsesi\u00f3n con capturar el presente, esa visi\u00f3n est\u00e1tica del mundo, no solo es limitante, sino que literalmente est\u00e1 rompiendo nuestros sistemas m\u00e1s cr\u00edticos.", "tokens": [51049, 28664, 5295, 257, 2624, 9736, 1515, 8057, 16825, 3181, 279, 2560, 416, 3770, 28586, 806, 28709, 11, 11342, 1452, 2560, 3192, 83, 2262, 1103, 7968, 11, 572, 6944, 785, 4948, 2879, 11, 18108, 631, 20411, 4082, 3192, 7438, 79, 7304, 24099, 48720, 3573, 39927, 9940, 13, 51688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05514457536780316, "compression_ratio": 1.5464285714285715, "no_speech_prob": 7.774890106726495e-12}, {"id": 11, "seek": 6970, "start": 96.54, "end": 99.08, "text": " Es un tema denso, pero fascinante.", "tokens": [51707, 2313, 517, 15854, 1441, 539, 11, 4768, 7184, 259, 2879, 13, 51834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05514457536780316, "compression_ratio": 1.5464285714285715, "no_speech_prob": 7.774890106726495e-12}, {"id": 12, "seek": 9908, "start": 99.08, "end": 115.4, "text": " Lo es. Estoy asombrada con este material. La misi\u00f3n de esta inmersi\u00f3n profunda es presentar un an\u00e1lisis a fondo de un conjunto de seis documentos t\u00e9cnicos, que la verdad son monumentales, escritos por el investigador conocido como flicci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50365, 6130, 785, 13, 49651, 382, 298, 1443, 1538, 416, 4065, 2527, 13, 2369, 3346, 2560, 368, 5283, 294, 18552, 2560, 1740, 11946, 785, 1974, 289, 517, 44113, 28436, 257, 38101, 368, 517, 37776, 368, 28233, 4166, 329, 25564, 48674, 11, 631, 635, 13692, 1872, 20289, 4229, 11, 4721, 42887, 1515, 806, 4557, 5409, 15871, 2925, 2617, 932, 299, 5687, 13, 51181], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09026877085367839, "compression_ratio": 1.4545454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 8.276488869252141e-12}, {"id": 13, "seek": 9908, "start": 115.66, "end": 117.56, "text": " Aj\u00e1, el famoso flicci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51194, 25862, 842, 11, 806, 49526, 932, 299, 5687, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09026877085367839, "compression_ratio": 1.4545454545454546, "no_speech_prob": 8.276488869252141e-12}, {"id": 14, "seek": 11756, "start": 117.56, "end": 133.2, "text": " Radical. O sea, dejar de ver el mundo como una serie de estados desconectados, como fotograf\u00edas, y empezar a entenderlo a trav\u00e9s de historias y continuaciones. B\u00e1sicamente ver procesos fluidos y futuros posibles.", "tokens": [50365, 9654, 804, 13, 422, 4158, 11, 24391, 368, 1306, 806, 7968, 2617, 2002, 23030, 368, 871, 4181, 7471, 546, 349, 4181, 11, 2617, 34341, 10025, 11, 288, 31168, 257, 20054, 752, 257, 24463, 368, 4058, 4609, 288, 2993, 9188, 13, 363, 2490, 23653, 1306, 17565, 329, 5029, 7895, 288, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 13, 51147], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07876554850874276, "compression_ratio": 1.3354037267080745, "no_speech_prob": 8.243951528374982e-12}, {"id": 15, "seek": 13320, "start": 133.2, "end": 143.22, "text": " \u00bfY el verdadero desaf\u00edo intelectual de esta exploraci\u00f3n? Digo, para nosotros hoy, es que vamos a conectar puntos que a simple vista parecen operar en universos paralelos.", "tokens": [50365, 3841, 56, 806, 13692, 2032, 34587, 20492, 2830, 1809, 901, 368, 5283, 24765, 3482, 30, 413, 7483, 11, 1690, 13863, 13775, 11, 785, 631, 5295, 257, 30458, 289, 34375, 631, 257, 2199, 22553, 7448, 13037, 2208, 289, 465, 5950, 329, 26009, 338, 329, 13, 50866], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08911372245626246, "compression_ratio": 1.4708333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 8.640032266027386e-12}, {"id": 16, "seek": 13320, "start": 143.44, "end": 144.54, "text": " S\u00ed, de locos.", "tokens": [50877, 12375, 11, 368, 1628, 329, 13, 50932], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08911372245626246, "compression_ratio": 1.4708333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 8.640032266027386e-12}, {"id": 17, "seek": 13320, "start": 144.85999999999999, "end": 153.38, "text": " Empezaremos viendo c\u00f3mo se construyen los lenguajes de programaci\u00f3n modernos. Luego pasaremos a la psicolog\u00eda cognitiva de c\u00f3mo los humanos ganamos experiencia.", "tokens": [50948, 3968, 15144, 23118, 34506, 12826, 369, 12946, 16580, 1750, 35044, 84, 29362, 368, 1461, 3482, 4363, 329, 13, 45665, 1736, 23118, 257, 635, 38609, 29987, 11786, 270, 5931, 368, 12826, 1750, 34555, 7574, 2151, 36489, 13, 51374], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08911372245626246, "compression_ratio": 1.4708333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 8.640032266027386e-12}, {"id": 18, "seek": 15338, "start": 153.38, "end": 161.0, "text": " Eh, rozaremos la crisis de la ciencia y la geometr\u00eda matem\u00e1tica, y terminaremos explicando la biomec\u00e1nica de c\u00f3mo camina un robot.", "tokens": [50365, 9663, 11, 9544, 23118, 635, 5869, 368, 635, 269, 30592, 288, 635, 12956, 37183, 3803, 443, 23432, 11, 288, 10761, 23118, 28021, 1806, 635, 3228, 423, 66, 7200, 2262, 368, 12826, 1945, 1426, 517, 7881, 13, 50746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07982857536723595, "compression_ratio": 1.5874125874125875, "no_speech_prob": 9.486295429739222e-12}, {"id": 19, "seek": 15338, "start": 161.34, "end": 162.72, "text": " Nada m\u00e1s y nada menos.", "tokens": [50763, 40992, 3573, 288, 8096, 8902, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07982857536723595, "compression_ratio": 1.5874125874125875, "no_speech_prob": 9.486295429739222e-12}, {"id": 20, "seek": 15338, "start": 162.94, "end": 171.85999999999999, "text": " Exacto. Y lo incre\u00edble es que todo, absolutamente todo, est\u00e1 regido por la misma falla en nuestra forma de pensar y la misma soluci\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica.", "tokens": [50843, 7199, 78, 13, 398, 450, 46202, 638, 785, 631, 5149, 11, 49285, 5149, 11, 3192, 1121, 2925, 1515, 635, 24946, 2100, 64, 465, 16825, 8366, 368, 18321, 288, 635, 24946, 24807, 5687, 3803, 443, 23432, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07982857536723595, "compression_ratio": 1.5874125874125875, "no_speech_prob": 9.486295429739222e-12}, {"id": 21, "seek": 15338, "start": 172.24, "end": 180.24, "text": " Ok, vamos a desempacar esto, empezando por el origen de esta frustraci\u00f3n, que, seg\u00fan los textos, nace en el mundo de la programaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51308, 3477, 11, 5295, 257, 730, 15970, 326, 289, 7433, 11, 18730, 1806, 1515, 806, 2349, 268, 368, 5283, 7454, 46205, 11, 631, 11, 36570, 1750, 2487, 329, 11, 297, 617, 465, 806, 7968, 368, 635, 1461, 3482, 13, 51708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07982857536723595, "compression_ratio": 1.5874125874125875, "no_speech_prob": 9.486295429739222e-12}, {"id": 22, "seek": 15338, "start": 180.78, "end": 181.3, "text": " As\u00ed es.", "tokens": [51735, 17419, 785, 13, 51761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07982857536723595, "compression_ratio": 1.5874125874125875, "no_speech_prob": 9.486295429739222e-12}, {"id": 23, "seek": 18130, "start": 181.3, "end": 187.02, "text": " El autor plantea un escenario con el que, digamos, cualquier ingeniero de software ha lidiado alguna vez.", "tokens": [50365, 2699, 19510, 36829, 64, 517, 4721, 49120, 416, 806, 631, 11, 36430, 11, 21004, 21600, 12030, 368, 4722, 324, 10252, 72, 1573, 20651, 5715, 13, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08963894477257361, "compression_ratio": 1.5147540983606558, "no_speech_prob": 8.983974154885832e-12}, {"id": 24, "seek": 18130, "start": 187.5, "end": 195.72, "text": " Abrir un archivo de c\u00f3digo masivo en un lenguaje como C++ a Swift, y sentir que literalmente te aplasta el peso de la historia.", "tokens": [50675, 31717, 347, 517, 3912, 6340, 368, 44195, 2300, 6340, 465, 517, 35044, 84, 11153, 2617, 383, 25472, 257, 25539, 11, 288, 23963, 631, 20411, 4082, 535, 25522, 12468, 806, 28149, 368, 635, 18385, 13, 51086], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08963894477257361, "compression_ratio": 1.5147540983606558, "no_speech_prob": 8.983974154885832e-12}, {"id": 25, "seek": 18130, "start": 196.34, "end": 199.34, "text": " E introduce un concepto llamado gravedad de proveedor.", "tokens": [51117, 462, 5366, 517, 3410, 78, 47055, 1295, 937, 345, 368, 7081, 34897, 13, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08963894477257361, "compression_ratio": 1.5147540983606558, "no_speech_prob": 8.983974154885832e-12}, {"id": 26, "seek": 18130, "start": 199.78, "end": 201.82000000000002, "text": " Ese t\u00e9rmino me parece brillante, la verdad.", "tokens": [51289, 462, 405, 45198, 78, 385, 14120, 8695, 2879, 11, 635, 13692, 13, 51391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08963894477257361, "compression_ratio": 1.5147540983606558, "no_speech_prob": 8.983974154885832e-12}, {"id": 27, "seek": 18130, "start": 202.18, "end": 209.98000000000002, "text": " S\u00ed. Entonces, \u00bfc\u00f3mo funciona esta gravedad y por qu\u00e9 convierte el acto de programar en, pues, un ejercicio de arqueolog\u00eda?", "tokens": [51409, 12375, 13, 15097, 11, 3841, 46614, 26210, 5283, 1295, 937, 345, 288, 1515, 8057, 3754, 23123, 806, 605, 78, 368, 1461, 289, 465, 11, 11059, 11, 517, 39151, 18322, 368, 594, 1077, 29987, 30, 51799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08963894477257361, "compression_ratio": 1.5147540983606558, "no_speech_prob": 8.983974154885832e-12}, {"id": 28, "seek": 20998, "start": 209.98, "end": 219.42, "text": " Bueno, y lo fascinante aqu\u00ed es c\u00f3mo redefine el concepto mismo de complejidad. En la ingenier\u00eda tradicional solemos dividir los problemas en dos.", "tokens": [50365, 16046, 11, 288, 450, 7184, 259, 2879, 6661, 785, 12826, 38818, 533, 806, 3410, 78, 12461, 368, 44424, 73, 4580, 13, 2193, 635, 21600, 811, 2686, 47956, 12321, 3415, 4996, 347, 1750, 20720, 465, 4491, 13, 50837], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09746824611317027, "compression_ratio": 1.2272727272727273, "no_speech_prob": 1.1667057077391352e-11}, {"id": 29, "seek": 20998, "start": 219.64, "end": 222.39999999999998, "text": " Aj\u00e1. La esencial y la accidental, \u00bfno?", "tokens": [50848, 25862, 842, 13, 2369, 785, 26567, 288, 635, 38094, 11, 3841, 1771, 30, 50986], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09746824611317027, "compression_ratio": 1.2272727272727273, "no_speech_prob": 1.1667057077391352e-11}, {"id": 30, "seek": 22240, "start": 222.4, "end": 233.56, "text": " Exacto. La complejidad esencial, que es lo dif\u00edcil que es el problema en s\u00ed que intentas resolver. Y la complejidad accidental, que es cuando tus herramientas son torpes.", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 2369, 44424, 73, 4580, 785, 26567, 11, 631, 785, 450, 17258, 631, 785, 806, 12395, 465, 8600, 631, 8446, 296, 34480, 13, 398, 635, 44424, 73, 4580, 38094, 11, 631, 785, 7767, 20647, 38271, 296, 1872, 3930, 5190, 13, 50923], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05513539521590523, "compression_ratio": 1.376, "no_speech_prob": 1.037901709022293e-11}, {"id": 31, "seek": 23356, "start": 233.56, "end": 239.26, "text": " Pero aqu\u00ed, Flaxion introduce una tercera dimensi\u00f3n, que es la complejidad hist\u00f3rica.", "tokens": [50365, 9377, 6661, 11, 479, 25923, 313, 5366, 2002, 1796, 41034, 5013, 694, 2560, 11, 631, 785, 635, 44424, 73, 4580, 33196, 15192, 13, 50650], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10868619038508488, "compression_ratio": 1.443089430894309, "no_speech_prob": 9.637801841322347e-12}, {"id": 32, "seek": 23356, "start": 239.66, "end": 240.98, "text": " Que es la que nadie menciona.", "tokens": [50670, 4493, 785, 635, 631, 28060, 37030, 64, 13, 50736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10868619038508488, "compression_ratio": 1.443089430894309, "no_speech_prob": 9.637801841322347e-12}, {"id": 33, "seek": 23356, "start": 241.3, "end": 251.6, "text": " Claro. Lenguajes como C++ o Swift operan bajo una gravedad masiva dictada por un proveedor gigantesco, digamos, Apple, o un comit\u00e9 corporativo o internacional.", "tokens": [50752, 33380, 13, 441, 1501, 84, 29362, 2617, 383, 25472, 277, 25539, 2208, 282, 30139, 2002, 1295, 937, 345, 2300, 5931, 12569, 1538, 1515, 517, 7081, 34897, 8741, 9327, 1291, 11, 36430, 11, 6373, 11, 277, 517, 395, 5066, 6804, 18586, 277, 37382, 13, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10868619038508488, "compression_ratio": 1.443089430894309, "no_speech_prob": 9.637801841322347e-12}, {"id": 34, "seek": 23356, "start": 252.44, "end": 256.84000000000003, "text": " En esos ecosistemas de c\u00f3digo, el mayor temor de todos es romper el pasado.", "tokens": [51309, 2193, 22411, 11007, 468, 26062, 368, 44195, 11, 806, 10120, 1383, 284, 368, 6321, 785, 7438, 610, 806, 24794, 13, 51529], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10868619038508488, "compression_ratio": 1.443089430894309, "no_speech_prob": 9.637801841322347e-12}, {"id": 35, "seek": 25684, "start": 256.84, "end": 259.17999999999995, "text": " O sea, la compatibilidad hacia atr\u00e1s.", "tokens": [50365, 422, 4158, 11, 635, 13147, 33989, 21365, 22906, 13, 50482], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07451355921757685, "compression_ratio": 1.325, "no_speech_prob": 9.41389240866064e-12}, {"id": 36, "seek": 25684, "start": 259.29999999999995, "end": 265.9, "text": " S\u00ed. Nunca, bajo ninguna circunstancia, quieren que un c\u00f3digo escrito, no s\u00e9, hace 10 a\u00f1os, deje de funcionar hoy.", "tokens": [50488, 12375, 13, 23696, 496, 11, 30139, 36073, 3510, 409, 18758, 2755, 11, 36706, 631, 517, 44195, 49451, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 10032, 1266, 11424, 11, 368, 2884, 368, 14186, 289, 13775, 13, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07451355921757685, "compression_ratio": 1.325, "no_speech_prob": 9.41389240866064e-12}, {"id": 37, "seek": 25684, "start": 265.96, "end": 272.76, "text": " Lo cual, a ver, suena muy noble en teor\u00eda. Pero en la pr\u00e1ctica significa que nunca puedes limpiar la casa.", "tokens": [50821, 6130, 10911, 11, 257, 1306, 11, 459, 4118, 5323, 20171, 465, 40238, 2686, 13, 9377, 465, 635, 27300, 29041, 19957, 631, 13768, 19010, 33174, 9448, 635, 9022, 13, 51161], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07451355921757685, "compression_ratio": 1.325, "no_speech_prob": 9.41389240866064e-12}, {"id": 38, "seek": 27276, "start": 272.76, "end": 285.64, "text": " Tienes los punteros de memoria originales de los a\u00f1os 80 conviviendo en el mismo espacio, con punteros inteligentes dise\u00f1ados en 2011, que a su vez conviven con reglas sem\u00e1nticas de 2014.", "tokens": [50365, 314, 1053, 279, 1750, 4468, 391, 329, 368, 1334, 8172, 3380, 279, 368, 1750, 11424, 4688, 3754, 592, 7304, 465, 806, 12461, 33845, 11, 416, 4468, 391, 329, 44300, 9240, 3814, 2791, 4181, 465, 10154, 11, 631, 257, 459, 5715, 3754, 5709, 416, 1121, 7743, 4361, 27525, 9150, 368, 8227, 13, 51009], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09764173574614943, "compression_ratio": 1.546875, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794044477679954e-11}, {"id": 39, "seek": 27276, "start": 286.5, "end": 289.62, "text": " El lenguaje se convierte en un f\u00f3sil viviente.", "tokens": [51052, 2699, 35044, 84, 11153, 369, 3754, 23123, 465, 517, 283, 12994, 388, 11005, 8413, 13, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09764173574614943, "compression_ratio": 1.546875, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794044477679954e-11}, {"id": 40, "seek": 27276, "start": 290.34, "end": 294.82, "text": " Totalmente. Se genera un sistema que est\u00e1 aterrado de su propia historia.", "tokens": [51244, 23170, 4082, 13, 1100, 1337, 64, 517, 13245, 631, 3192, 257, 391, 14974, 368, 459, 40464, 18385, 13, 51468], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09764173574614943, "compression_ratio": 1.546875, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794044477679954e-11}, {"id": 41, "seek": 27276, "start": 295.28, "end": 300.12, "text": " As\u00ed que intenta gestionarla creando reglas de estado cada vez y m\u00e1s complicadas.", "tokens": [51491, 17419, 631, 8446, 64, 7219, 33639, 875, 1197, 1806, 1121, 7743, 368, 18372, 8411, 5715, 288, 3573, 16060, 6872, 13, 51733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09764173574614943, "compression_ratio": 1.546875, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794044477679954e-11}, {"id": 42, "seek": 30012, "start": 300.12, "end": 307.88, "text": " Y el contraste se hace con lenguajes como Python, que tienen lo que el texto llama gravedad de ecosistema.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 806, 8712, 68, 369, 10032, 416, 35044, 84, 29362, 2617, 15329, 11, 631, 12536, 450, 631, 806, 35503, 23272, 1295, 937, 345, 368, 11007, 468, 5619, 13, 50753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.081716091833382, "compression_ratio": 1.4959677419354838, "no_speech_prob": 1.00993666554694e-11}, {"id": 43, "seek": 30012, "start": 308.52, "end": 310.16, "text": " Que es m\u00e1s distribuida, \u00bfverdad?", "tokens": [50785, 4493, 785, 3573, 4400, 84, 2887, 11, 3841, 331, 20034, 30, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.081716091833382, "compression_ratio": 1.4959677419354838, "no_speech_prob": 1.00993666554694e-11}, {"id": 44, "seek": 30012, "start": 310.6, "end": 321.5, "text": " Exacto. Al ser impulsado por una comunidad distribuida, Python se permite hacer transiciones dolorosas pero necesarias, como el salto tan pol\u00e9mico de Python 2 a Python 3.", "tokens": [50889, 7199, 78, 13, 967, 816, 704, 9468, 1573, 1515, 2002, 35695, 4400, 84, 2887, 11, 15329, 369, 31105, 6720, 1145, 29719, 42416, 42393, 4768, 11909, 35027, 11, 2617, 806, 1845, 1353, 7603, 1180, 4011, 2789, 368, 15329, 568, 257, 15329, 805, 13, 51434], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.081716091833382, "compression_ratio": 1.4959677419354838, "no_speech_prob": 1.00993666554694e-11}, {"id": 45, "seek": 30012, "start": 321.7, "end": 324.84000000000003, "text": " Ah, s\u00ed, que rompi\u00f3 un mont\u00f3n de c\u00f3digo en su momento.", "tokens": [51444, 2438, 11, 8600, 11, 631, 7438, 79, 7138, 517, 45259, 368, 44195, 465, 459, 9333, 13, 51601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.081716091833382, "compression_ratio": 1.4959677419354838, "no_speech_prob": 1.00993666554694e-11}, {"id": 46, "seek": 32484, "start": 324.84, "end": 334.67999999999995, "text": " S\u00ed, rompieron compatibilidad, caus\u00f3 dolores de cabeza, pero evitaron convertirse en un museo de reliquias de c\u00f3digo. Lograron avanzar.", "tokens": [50365, 12375, 11, 7438, 79, 14440, 13147, 33989, 11, 3302, 812, 17858, 2706, 368, 34615, 11, 4768, 31326, 266, 7620, 36097, 465, 517, 39138, 78, 368, 1039, 3221, 4609, 368, 44195, 13, 10824, 5352, 266, 42444, 289, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10724981548716721, "compression_ratio": 1.5104602510460252, "no_speech_prob": 8.571285174674426e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 32484, "start": 335.17999999999995, "end": 343.94, "text": " Y para solucionar este estancamiento a nivel fundamental, el autor no solo critica, sino que propone un lenguaje de programaci\u00f3n completamente te\u00f3rico.", "tokens": [50882, 398, 1690, 1404, 1311, 33639, 4065, 871, 4463, 16971, 257, 24423, 8088, 11, 806, 19510, 572, 6944, 3113, 2262, 11, 18108, 631, 2365, 546, 517, 35044, 84, 11153, 368, 1461, 3482, 28381, 535, 812, 23776, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10724981548716721, "compression_ratio": 1.5104602510460252, "no_speech_prob": 8.571285174674426e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 32484, "start": 344.78, "end": 346.32, "text": " Lo llama SpherePop.", "tokens": [51362, 6130, 23272, 318, 6605, 38677, 13, 51439], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10724981548716721, "compression_ratio": 1.5104602510460252, "no_speech_prob": 8.571285174674426e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 32484, "start": 346.85999999999996, "end": 350.4, "text": " SpherePop, s\u00ed. Un experimento mental fascinante.", "tokens": [51466, 318, 6605, 38677, 11, 8600, 13, 1156, 5120, 78, 4973, 7184, 259, 2879, 13, 51643], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10724981548716721, "compression_ratio": 1.5104602510460252, "no_speech_prob": 8.571285174674426e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 35040, "start": 350.4, "end": 358.96, "text": " Un lenguaje que invierte la regla de oro. En lugar de que el estado sea lo m\u00e1s importante, aqu\u00ed la historia es el n\u00facleo del universo.", "tokens": [50365, 1156, 35044, 84, 11153, 631, 1048, 23123, 635, 1121, 875, 368, 45150, 13, 2193, 11467, 368, 631, 806, 18372, 4158, 450, 3573, 9416, 11, 6661, 635, 18385, 785, 806, 11908, 2160, 78, 1103, 42332, 13, 50793], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08964854962116964, "compression_ratio": 1.4166666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 9.232596458186304e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 35040, "start": 359.73999999999995, "end": 364.06, "text": " Y supuestamente funciona con solo cuatro verbos, o primitivas.", "tokens": [50832, 398, 9331, 11493, 3439, 26210, 416, 6944, 28795, 9595, 329, 11, 277, 2886, 270, 24759, 13, 51048], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08964854962116964, "compression_ratio": 1.4166666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 9.232596458186304e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 35040, "start": 364.65999999999997, "end": 368.44, "text": " \u00bfC\u00f3mo construir\u00edas un software entero con solo cuatro instrucciones?", "tokens": [51078, 3841, 28342, 38445, 10025, 517, 4722, 948, 2032, 416, 6944, 28795, 1058, 894, 35560, 30, 51267], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08964854962116964, "compression_ratio": 1.4166666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 9.232596458186304e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 36844, "start": 368.44, "end": 382.56, "text": " Pues, a ver, parecer\u00eda imposible a primera vista, pero la l\u00f3gica interna es impecable. Las cuatro primitivas son, primero, POP, que significa seleccionar una opci\u00f3n de m\u00faltiples futuros posibles.", "tokens": [50365, 22386, 11, 257, 1306, 11, 44885, 2686, 38396, 964, 257, 17382, 22553, 11, 4768, 635, 48475, 2262, 728, 629, 785, 19643, 66, 712, 13, 10663, 28795, 2886, 270, 24759, 1872, 11, 21289, 11, 430, 12059, 11, 631, 19957, 23264, 1914, 33639, 2002, 999, 5687, 368, 275, 43447, 72, 2622, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 13, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09386181475511238, "compression_ratio": 1.38125, "no_speech_prob": 9.788870235227787e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 36844, "start": 382.96, "end": 384.28, "text": " Ok, elegir un camino.", "tokens": [51091, 3477, 11, 14459, 347, 517, 34124, 13, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09386181475511238, "compression_ratio": 1.38125, "no_speech_prob": 9.788870235227787e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 38428, "start": 384.28, "end": 399.78, "text": " Exacto. La segunda es Refuse, que es rechazar expl\u00edcitamente un camino. La tercera es Bind, que es tomar una variable y atarla a un concepto para restringir el futuro. Y finalmente, Colapse.", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 2369, 21978, 785, 16957, 438, 11, 631, 785, 319, 339, 22795, 1490, 870, 45135, 3439, 517, 34124, 13, 2369, 1796, 41034, 785, 363, 471, 11, 631, 785, 22048, 2002, 7006, 288, 412, 34148, 257, 517, 3410, 78, 1690, 1472, 2937, 347, 806, 23953, 13, 398, 35577, 11, 4004, 11145, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10473323246789357, "compression_ratio": 1.348993288590604, "no_speech_prob": 8.809587608016312e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 38428, "start": 400.0, "end": 400.55999999999995, "text": " Colapsar.", "tokens": [51151, 4004, 2382, 289, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10473323246789357, "compression_ratio": 1.348993288590604, "no_speech_prob": 8.809587608016312e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 40056, "start": 400.56, "end": 411.32, "text": " S\u00ed, colapsar la historia en un estado temporal. En un sistema tradicional de programaci\u00f3n, el c\u00f3digo que vemos en pantalla es, digamos, la verdad absoluta de la m\u00e1quina.", "tokens": [50365, 12375, 11, 1173, 2382, 289, 635, 18385, 465, 517, 18372, 30881, 13, 2193, 517, 13245, 47956, 368, 1461, 3482, 11, 806, 44195, 631, 20909, 465, 44449, 785, 11, 36430, 11, 635, 13692, 18757, 64, 368, 635, 49360, 13, 50903], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05020196097237723, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 9.017607840999808e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 40056, "start": 411.78000000000003, "end": 412.92, "text": " Lo que ves es lo que hay.", "tokens": [50926, 6130, 631, 28274, 785, 450, 631, 4842, 13, 50983], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05020196097237723, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 9.017607840999808e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 40056, "start": 413.22, "end": 424.38, "text": " Claro. Pero en SpherePop, el c\u00f3digo en pantalla es solo un colapse temporal. Es una sombra proyectada por una historia de decisiones mucho m\u00e1s rica que el sistema preserva en el fondo.", "tokens": [50998, 33380, 13, 9377, 465, 318, 6605, 38677, 11, 806, 44195, 465, 44449, 785, 6944, 517, 1173, 11145, 30881, 13, 2313, 2002, 3307, 6198, 23832, 1538, 1515, 2002, 18385, 368, 3537, 279, 9824, 3573, 367, 2262, 631, 806, 13245, 45905, 64, 465, 806, 38101, 13, 51556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05020196097237723, "compression_ratio": 1.628691983122363, "no_speech_prob": 9.017607840999808e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 42438, "start": 424.38, "end": 436.64, "text": " O sea, trata el c\u00f3digo de la misma manera que el sistema de control de versiones Git trata nuestros proyectos. En Git, la historia de los commits, de los cambios que uno hace, es la verdadera base de datos.", "tokens": [50365, 422, 4158, 11, 31920, 806, 44195, 368, 635, 24946, 13913, 631, 806, 13245, 368, 1969, 368, 3037, 279, 16939, 31920, 24099, 23832, 329, 13, 2193, 16939, 11, 635, 18385, 368, 1750, 48311, 11, 368, 1750, 18751, 2717, 631, 8526, 10032, 11, 785, 635, 13692, 1663, 3096, 368, 27721, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04329513311386109, "compression_ratio": 1.6056338028169015, "no_speech_prob": 8.879320022303627e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 42438, "start": 436.8, "end": 437.18, "text": " Tal cual.", "tokens": [50986, 10516, 10911, 13, 51005], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04329513311386109, "compression_ratio": 1.6056338028169015, "no_speech_prob": 8.879320022303627e-12}, {"id": 62, "seek": 42438, "start": 437.38, "end": 452.0, "text": " El archivo que tengo abierto en mi editor de texto en este preciso momento es medio irrelevante a largo plazo. Es solo una proyecci\u00f3n moment\u00e1nea. Por eso, en Git, si hay un error, no tienes que adivinar qu\u00e9 pas\u00f3 haciendo arqueolog\u00eda.", "tokens": [51015, 2699, 3912, 6340, 631, 13989, 410, 20747, 465, 2752, 9839, 368, 35503, 465, 4065, 30109, 9333, 785, 22123, 16014, 28316, 2879, 257, 31245, 499, 29722, 13, 2313, 6944, 2002, 447, 1200, 14735, 1623, 842, 22160, 13, 5269, 7287, 11, 465, 16939, 11, 1511, 4842, 517, 6713, 11, 572, 20716, 631, 614, 592, 6470, 8057, 41382, 20509, 594, 1077, 29987, 13, 51746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04329513311386109, "compression_ratio": 1.6056338028169015, "no_speech_prob": 8.879320022303627e-12}, {"id": 63, "seek": 45200, "start": 452.0, "end": 455.14, "text": " La historia ya est\u00e1 documentada paso a paso.", "tokens": [50365, 2369, 18385, 2478, 3192, 4166, 1538, 29212, 257, 29212, 13, 50522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13073408603668213, "compression_ratio": 1.418848167539267, "no_speech_prob": 9.982474916125916e-12}, {"id": 64, "seek": 45200, "start": 455.58, "end": 463.72, "text": " Esa es la comparaci\u00f3n perfecta. Al poner la historia en el centro del sistema, eliminas la necesidad de memorizar reyes oscuras de estado.", "tokens": [50544, 2313, 64, 785, 635, 6311, 3482, 2176, 64, 13, 967, 19149, 635, 18385, 465, 806, 24607, 1103, 13245, 11, 7892, 296, 635, 11909, 4580, 368, 10560, 9736, 319, 2346, 3003, 66, 12907, 368, 18372, 13, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13073408603668213, "compression_ratio": 1.418848167539267, "no_speech_prob": 9.982474916125916e-12}, {"id": 65, "seek": 45200, "start": 464.2, "end": 468.92, "text": " Pero, a ver, tengo que hacer la pregunta obligada. Como abogada del diablo.", "tokens": [50975, 9377, 11, 257, 1306, 11, 13989, 631, 6720, 635, 24252, 9270, 1538, 13, 11913, 410, 664, 1538, 1103, 1026, 21991, 13, 51211], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13073408603668213, "compression_ratio": 1.418848167539267, "no_speech_prob": 9.982474916125916e-12}, {"id": 66, "seek": 45200, "start": 469.38, "end": 469.84, "text": " Adelante.", "tokens": [51234, 1999, 338, 2879, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13073408603668213, "compression_ratio": 1.418848167539267, "no_speech_prob": 9.982474916125916e-12}, {"id": 67, "seek": 46984, "start": 469.84, "end": 483.32, "text": " Si en este lenguaje te\u00f3rico nunca borramos la historia, o sea, si cada elecci\u00f3n y cada rechazo se documentan perpetuamente, \u00bfno se agotar\u00e1 la memoria de la computadora en cuesti\u00f3n de, no s\u00e9, minutos?", "tokens": [50365, 4909, 465, 4065, 35044, 84, 11153, 535, 812, 23776, 13768, 14828, 30227, 635, 18385, 11, 277, 4158, 11, 1511, 8411, 1118, 14735, 288, 8411, 319, 339, 29722, 369, 4166, 282, 16211, 84, 3439, 11, 3841, 1771, 369, 623, 310, 21534, 635, 1334, 8172, 368, 635, 2807, 23020, 465, 50216, 368, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 19421, 30, 51039], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04116401421396356, "compression_ratio": 1.4549356223175967, "no_speech_prob": 9.599881653499232e-12}, {"id": 68, "seek": 46984, "start": 483.85999999999996, "end": 491.59999999999997, "text": " Suena a tener un s\u00edndrome de acumulaci\u00f3n compulsiva digital donde guardamos recibos del supermercado de hace 15 a\u00f1os por si acaso.", "tokens": [51066, 2746, 4118, 257, 11640, 517, 8600, 273, 11505, 368, 41343, 425, 3482, 42773, 5931, 4562, 10488, 6290, 2151, 46387, 329, 1103, 1687, 936, 27713, 368, 10032, 2119, 11424, 1515, 1511, 696, 35281, 13, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04116401421396356, "compression_ratio": 1.4549356223175967, "no_speech_prob": 9.599881653499232e-12}, {"id": 69, "seek": 49160, "start": 491.6, "end": 498.3, "text": " Claro, claro. Y esa es precisamente la objeci\u00f3n que har\u00eda cualquier ingeniero de sistemas tradicional al leer esto.", "tokens": [50365, 33380, 11, 16742, 13, 398, 11342, 785, 44901, 635, 1111, 2884, 5687, 631, 2233, 2686, 21004, 21600, 12030, 368, 48720, 47956, 419, 34172, 7433, 13, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09721545835511874, "compression_ratio": 1.5338345864661653, "no_speech_prob": 8.40660700773821e-12}, {"id": 70, "seek": 49160, "start": 498.72, "end": 505.18, "text": " Pero, el modelo de SpherePop no ignora el problema de quedarse sin memoria. Simplemente cambia la forma en que lo pensamos.", "tokens": [50721, 9377, 11, 806, 27825, 368, 318, 6605, 38677, 572, 5335, 3252, 806, 12395, 368, 13617, 11668, 3343, 1334, 8172, 13, 21532, 4082, 18751, 654, 635, 8366, 465, 631, 450, 6099, 2151, 13, 51044], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09721545835511874, "compression_ratio": 1.5338345864661653, "no_speech_prob": 8.40660700773821e-12}, {"id": 71, "seek": 49160, "start": 505.38, "end": 506.0, "text": " A ver, \u00bfc\u00f3mo?", "tokens": [51054, 316, 1306, 11, 3841, 46614, 30, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09721545835511874, "compression_ratio": 1.5338345864661653, "no_speech_prob": 8.40660700773821e-12}, {"id": 72, "seek": 49160, "start": 506.32000000000005, "end": 514.0, "text": " En la programaci\u00f3n orientada al estado, la recolecci\u00f3n de basura, que es el proceso de liberar memoria, es una operaci\u00f3n completamente ciega.", "tokens": [51101, 2193, 635, 1461, 3482, 8579, 1538, 419, 18372, 11, 635, 850, 4812, 14735, 368, 987, 2991, 11, 631, 785, 806, 29314, 368, 6774, 289, 1334, 8172, 11, 785, 2002, 2208, 3482, 28381, 30596, 3680, 13, 51485], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09721545835511874, "compression_ratio": 1.5338345864661653, "no_speech_prob": 8.40660700773821e-12}, {"id": 73, "seek": 49160, "start": 514.16, "end": 514.5400000000001, "text": " Aj\u00e1.", "tokens": [51493, 25862, 842, 13, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09721545835511874, "compression_ratio": 1.5338345864661653, "no_speech_prob": 8.40660700773821e-12}, {"id": 74, "seek": 51454, "start": 514.54, "end": 521.24, "text": " El sistema pregunta, \u00bfalguien est\u00e1 usando este objeto ahora mismo? No. Entonces lo borro. As\u00ed de simple.", "tokens": [50365, 2699, 13245, 24252, 11, 3841, 304, 2794, 1053, 3192, 29798, 4065, 40438, 9923, 12461, 30, 883, 13, 15097, 450, 14828, 340, 13, 17419, 368, 2199, 13, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06509188924516951, "compression_ratio": 1.4536082474226804, "no_speech_prob": 8.844077380165682e-12}, {"id": 75, "seek": 51454, "start": 521.9599999999999, "end": 530.8399999999999, "text": " En un sistema orientado a la historia, la pregunta es sem\u00e1ntica. La pregunta es, \u00bfqu\u00e9 partes de esta historia ya no son causalmente relevantes para ning\u00fan futuro posible?", "tokens": [50736, 2193, 517, 13245, 8579, 1573, 257, 635, 18385, 11, 635, 24252, 785, 4361, 27525, 2262, 13, 2369, 24252, 785, 11, 3841, 16412, 31210, 368, 5283, 18385, 2478, 572, 1872, 38755, 4082, 7340, 279, 1690, 30394, 23953, 26644, 30, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06509188924516951, "compression_ratio": 1.4536082474226804, "no_speech_prob": 8.844077380165682e-12}, {"id": 76, "seek": 53084, "start": 530.84, "end": 546.72, "text": " Ah, ok. Aqu\u00ed es donde se pone realmente interesante. Porque no se trata de cu\u00e1ndo borrar algo por falta de espacio, sino de qu\u00e9 borrar sin alterar la l\u00f3gica de las cosas que a\u00fan pueden suceder.", "tokens": [50365, 2438, 11, 3133, 13, 24386, 785, 10488, 369, 40192, 14446, 36396, 13, 11287, 572, 369, 31920, 368, 2702, 18606, 78, 14828, 5352, 8655, 1515, 22111, 368, 33845, 11, 18108, 368, 8057, 14828, 5352, 3343, 11337, 289, 635, 48475, 2262, 368, 2439, 12218, 631, 31676, 14714, 41928, 260, 13, 51159], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05684929563288103, "compression_ratio": 1.3354430379746836, "no_speech_prob": 8.605985715726128e-12}, {"id": 77, "seek": 53084, "start": 547.02, "end": 547.5400000000001, "text": " Exactamente.", "tokens": [51174, 7199, 3439, 13, 51200], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05684929563288103, "compression_ratio": 1.3354430379746836, "no_speech_prob": 8.605985715726128e-12}, {"id": 78, "seek": 54754, "start": 547.54, "end": 559.5999999999999, "text": " Y lo que me vuela la cabeza, de verdad, es que el autor toma esta idea exacta de comprimir la historia en una computadora y la aplica directamente a la biolog\u00eda, espec\u00edficamente al cerebro humano.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 450, 631, 385, 371, 16079, 635, 34615, 11, 368, 13692, 11, 785, 631, 806, 19510, 39728, 5283, 1558, 1900, 64, 368, 715, 5565, 347, 635, 18385, 465, 2002, 2807, 23020, 288, 635, 25522, 2262, 46230, 257, 635, 3228, 29987, 11, 32741, 3439, 419, 11643, 9120, 30985, 13, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05295724746508476, "compression_ratio": 1.470899470899471, "no_speech_prob": 9.600437632373282e-12}, {"id": 79, "seek": 54754, "start": 560.12, "end": 564.8, "text": " Cambiamos de m\u00e1quinas de pronto a maestros de ajedrez y a mec\u00e1nicos expertos.", "tokens": [50994, 29287, 72, 2151, 368, 39701, 17094, 368, 26194, 257, 463, 377, 2635, 368, 17680, 292, 17693, 288, 257, 25186, 7200, 9940, 5844, 329, 13, 51228], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05295724746508476, "compression_ratio": 1.470899470899471, "no_speech_prob": 9.600437632373282e-12}, {"id": 80, "seek": 56480, "start": 564.8, "end": 575.4, "text": " As\u00ed es. Es un salto incre\u00edble. Si queremos entender c\u00f3mo los humanos adquieran maestr\u00eda, en cualquier disciplina, tenemos que entender c\u00f3mo comprimen su propia historia.", "tokens": [50365, 17419, 785, 13, 2313, 517, 1845, 1353, 46202, 638, 13, 4909, 26813, 20054, 12826, 1750, 34555, 614, 16622, 282, 463, 377, 37183, 11, 465, 21004, 8644, 1426, 11, 9914, 631, 20054, 12826, 715, 5565, 268, 459, 40464, 18385, 13, 50895], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.059771325853135854, "compression_ratio": 1.56, "no_speech_prob": 9.865149495913439e-12}, {"id": 81, "seek": 56480, "start": 575.9399999999999, "end": 582.12, "text": " El mito popular dice que un gran maestro de ajedrez, por ejemplo, tiene un cerebro que funciona como una supercomputadora.", "tokens": [50922, 2699, 2194, 78, 3743, 10313, 631, 517, 9370, 463, 32389, 368, 17680, 292, 17693, 11, 1515, 13358, 11, 7066, 517, 11643, 9120, 631, 26210, 2617, 2002, 27839, 2582, 23020, 13, 51231], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.059771325853135854, "compression_ratio": 1.56, "no_speech_prob": 9.865149495913439e-12}, {"id": 82, "seek": 56480, "start": 582.26, "end": 585.3, "text": " S\u00ed, que puede calcular miles de jugadas por segundo.", "tokens": [51238, 12375, 11, 631, 8919, 2104, 17792, 6193, 368, 9568, 6872, 1515, 17954, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.059771325853135854, "compression_ratio": 1.56, "no_speech_prob": 9.865149495913439e-12}, {"id": 83, "seek": 58530, "start": 585.3, "end": 594.3399999999999, "text": " Exacto. Mucho m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido que un novato. Pero los estudios cognitivos que cita Flaccion muestran que esto es totalmente falso. No calculan m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido.", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 12313, 78, 3573, 24893, 631, 517, 23883, 2513, 13, 9377, 1750, 13542, 2717, 11786, 270, 16501, 631, 269, 2786, 3235, 8476, 313, 2992, 377, 4257, 631, 7433, 785, 30865, 3704, 539, 13, 883, 4322, 282, 3573, 24893, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07630390167236328, "compression_ratio": 1.481081081081081, "no_speech_prob": 8.741018325819638e-12}, {"id": 84, "seek": 58530, "start": 595.0, "end": 601.2199999999999, "text": " Entonces, si no est\u00e1n calculando m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido en tiempo real, \u00bfqu\u00e9 es lo que est\u00e1n haciendo cuando miran el tablero?", "tokens": [50850, 15097, 11, 1511, 572, 10368, 4322, 1806, 3573, 24893, 465, 11772, 957, 11, 3841, 16412, 785, 450, 631, 10368, 20509, 7767, 3149, 282, 806, 4421, 1918, 78, 30, 51161], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07630390167236328, "compression_ratio": 1.481081081081081, "no_speech_prob": 8.741018325819638e-12}, {"id": 85, "seek": 60122, "start": 601.22, "end": 616.6, "text": " Tienen una historia comprimida. A ver, pensemos en el novato. Cuando un principiante se enfrenta a un problema mec\u00e1nico complejo o un tablero de ajedrez, opera con lo que el texto denomina una alta entrop\u00eda de reparaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50365, 314, 22461, 2002, 18385, 715, 5565, 2887, 13, 316, 1306, 11, 11209, 3415, 465, 806, 23883, 2513, 13, 21907, 517, 6959, 72, 2879, 369, 33771, 64, 257, 517, 12395, 25186, 7200, 2789, 44424, 5134, 277, 517, 4421, 1918, 78, 368, 17680, 292, 17693, 11, 22202, 416, 450, 631, 806, 35503, 1441, 49217, 2002, 26495, 948, 1513, 2686, 368, 33291, 3482, 13, 51134], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06721835477011544, "compression_ratio": 1.510989010989011, "no_speech_prob": 9.196061447058756e-12}, {"id": 86, "seek": 60122, "start": 617.08, "end": 621.34, "text": " Alta entrop\u00eda de reparaci\u00f3n. O sea, caos y duda.", "tokens": [51158, 967, 1328, 948, 1513, 2686, 368, 33291, 3482, 13, 422, 4158, 11, 1335, 329, 288, 43881, 13, 51371], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06721835477011544, "compression_ratio": 1.510989010989011, "no_speech_prob": 9.196061447058756e-12}, {"id": 87, "seek": 62134, "start": 621.34, "end": 633.0400000000001, "text": " S\u00ed. Cada paso que da es incierto. Si se equivoca, tiene que retroceder paso a paso, reconstruyendo todo su proceso mental, porque su conocimiento est\u00e1 fragmentado.", "tokens": [50365, 12375, 13, 38603, 29212, 631, 1120, 785, 294, 537, 13098, 13, 4909, 369, 1267, 6340, 496, 11, 7066, 631, 18820, 1232, 260, 29212, 257, 29212, 11, 16891, 894, 88, 3999, 5149, 459, 29314, 4973, 11, 4021, 459, 15871, 14007, 3192, 26424, 1573, 13, 50950], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06872804250035967, "compression_ratio": 1.5393258426966292, "no_speech_prob": 7.990537918833862e-12}, {"id": 88, "seek": 62134, "start": 633.76, "end": 638.5600000000001, "text": " El experto, en cambio, ha pasado a\u00f1os haciendo lo que llamamos pr\u00e1ctica deliberada.", "tokens": [50986, 2699, 1086, 1353, 11, 465, 28731, 11, 324, 24794, 11424, 20509, 450, 631, 16848, 2151, 27300, 29041, 14207, 1538, 13, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06872804250035967, "compression_ratio": 1.5393258426966292, "no_speech_prob": 7.990537918833862e-12}, {"id": 89, "seek": 62134, "start": 638.7, "end": 650.36, "text": " Que, para aclarar, no es solo repetir lo mismo una y otra vez de forma autom\u00e1tica, sino cometer errores deliberados, analizarlos y registrar las correcciones.", "tokens": [51233, 4493, 11, 1690, 696, 2200, 289, 11, 572, 785, 6944, 13645, 347, 450, 12461, 2002, 288, 13623, 5715, 368, 8366, 3553, 23432, 11, 18108, 395, 2398, 45935, 495, 14207, 4181, 11, 2624, 590, 39734, 288, 11376, 5352, 2439, 29731, 35560, 13, 51816], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06872804250035967, "compression_ratio": 1.5393258426966292, "no_speech_prob": 7.990537918833862e-12}, {"id": 90, "seek": 65036, "start": 650.36, "end": 663.12, "text": " Exacto. Acumulan una estructura hist\u00f3rica masiva de intentos, fallos y ajustes. Y luego, y aqu\u00ed est\u00e1 la magia, el cerebro hace exactamente lo que hace ese lenguaje de programaci\u00f3n que discut\u00edamos.", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 5097, 449, 40701, 2002, 43935, 2991, 33196, 15192, 2300, 5931, 368, 8446, 329, 11, 2100, 329, 288, 41023, 279, 13, 398, 17222, 11, 288, 6661, 3192, 635, 2258, 654, 11, 806, 11643, 9120, 10032, 48686, 450, 631, 10032, 10167, 35044, 84, 11153, 368, 1461, 3482, 631, 42085, 16275, 13, 51003], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10136557040007219, "compression_ratio": 1.5018450184501846, "no_speech_prob": 6.9423260543044485e-12}, {"id": 91, "seek": 65036, "start": 663.86, "end": 669.26, "text": " Pregunta qu\u00e9 partes de esa historia ya no son causalmente relevantes y colapsa el resto.", "tokens": [51040, 430, 3375, 46380, 8057, 31210, 368, 11342, 18385, 2478, 572, 1872, 38755, 4082, 7340, 279, 288, 1173, 2382, 64, 806, 28247, 13, 51310], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10136557040007219, "compression_ratio": 1.5018450184501846, "no_speech_prob": 6.9423260543044485e-12}, {"id": 92, "seek": 65036, "start": 669.52, "end": 669.98, "text": " \u00a1Guau!", "tokens": [51323, 6514, 25627, 1459, 0, 51346], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10136557040007219, "compression_ratio": 1.5018450184501846, "no_speech_prob": 6.9423260543044485e-12}, {"id": 93, "seek": 65036, "start": 670.52, "end": 676.78, "text": " El cerebro del experto comprime miles de horas de ensayo y error en un solo operador cognitivo rapid\u00edsimo.", "tokens": [51373, 2699, 11643, 9120, 1103, 1086, 1353, 16802, 1312, 6193, 368, 19548, 368, 3489, 48947, 288, 6713, 465, 517, 6944, 2208, 5409, 11786, 270, 6340, 7558, 49889, 13, 51686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10136557040007219, "compression_ratio": 1.5018450184501846, "no_speech_prob": 6.9423260543044485e-12}, {"id": 94, "seek": 67678, "start": 676.78, "end": 693.74, "text": " Esa debe ser la raz\u00f3n por la cual, cuando le preguntas a un verdadero maestro por qu\u00e9 tom\u00f3 una decisi\u00f3n brillante en una fracci\u00f3n de segundo, muchas veces se queda sin palabras y te dice, no s\u00e9, fue intuici\u00f3n o simplemente sent\u00ed que era lo correcto.", "tokens": [50365, 2313, 64, 27422, 816, 635, 38310, 1515, 635, 10911, 11, 7767, 476, 39722, 257, 517, 13692, 2032, 463, 32389, 1515, 8057, 2916, 812, 2002, 18206, 2560, 8695, 2879, 465, 2002, 431, 49354, 368, 17954, 11, 16072, 17054, 369, 23314, 3343, 35240, 288, 535, 10313, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 9248, 560, 84, 15534, 277, 33190, 2279, 870, 631, 4249, 450, 3006, 78, 13, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06855574020972618, "compression_ratio": 1.4405940594059405, "no_speech_prob": 8.309128558814383e-12}, {"id": 95, "seek": 67678, "start": 694.04, "end": 695.9399999999999, "text": " S\u00ed. Te responden con vaguedades.", "tokens": [51228, 12375, 13, 1989, 4196, 268, 416, 13501, 5827, 2977, 13, 51323], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06855574020972618, "compression_ratio": 1.4405940594059405, "no_speech_prob": 8.309128558814383e-12}, {"id": 96, "seek": 69594, "start": 695.94, "end": 703.34, "text": " Y como entrevistadora, a veces una piensa que est\u00e1n siendo esquivos o que quieren guardarse el secreto de su \u00e9xito para ellos solos.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 2617, 39095, 468, 23020, 11, 257, 17054, 2002, 3895, 23364, 631, 10368, 31423, 34611, 16501, 277, 631, 36706, 6290, 11668, 806, 34432, 1353, 368, 459, 1136, 87, 3528, 1690, 16353, 1404, 329, 13, 50735], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0734703623015305, "compression_ratio": 1.5325670498084292, "no_speech_prob": 9.676448010920158e-12}, {"id": 97, "seek": 69594, "start": 703.98, "end": 708.0, "text": " Pero bajo este marco te\u00f3rico, no est\u00e1n ocultando nada a prop\u00f3sito.", "tokens": [50767, 9377, 30139, 4065, 1849, 1291, 535, 812, 23776, 11, 572, 10368, 10409, 723, 1806, 8096, 257, 2365, 12994, 3528, 13, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0734703623015305, "compression_ratio": 1.5325670498084292, "no_speech_prob": 9.676448010920158e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 69594, "start": 708.96, "end": 715.6400000000001, "text": " Literalmente, al colapsar la historia en su cerebro, perdieron el acceso a los datos originales no comprimidos.", "tokens": [51016, 16090, 304, 4082, 11, 419, 1173, 2382, 289, 635, 18385, 465, 459, 11643, 9120, 11, 12611, 14440, 806, 49284, 257, 1750, 27721, 3380, 279, 572, 715, 5565, 7895, 13, 51350], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0734703623015305, "compression_ratio": 1.5325670498084292, "no_speech_prob": 9.676448010920158e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 69594, "start": 716.2600000000001, "end": 720.86, "text": " El andamiaje de pasos intermedios fue borrado por la memoria para ahorrar recursos.", "tokens": [51381, 2699, 293, 335, 654, 2884, 368, 1736, 329, 728, 1912, 2717, 9248, 14828, 14974, 1515, 635, 1334, 8172, 1690, 44249, 5352, 30409, 13, 51611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0734703623015305, "compression_ratio": 1.5325670498084292, "no_speech_prob": 9.676448010920158e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 72086, "start": 720.86, "end": 727.14, "text": " Tal cual. Y eso, aunque parezca una ventaja enorme, nos revela una vulnerabilidad gigantesca.", "tokens": [50365, 10516, 10911, 13, 398, 7287, 11, 21962, 7448, 89, 496, 2002, 6931, 12908, 33648, 11, 3269, 15262, 64, 2002, 8184, 5177, 4580, 8741, 9327, 496, 13, 50679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08504663951813228, "compression_ratio": 1.5018050541516246, "no_speech_prob": 8.706543298819813e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 72086, "start": 727.72, "end": 733.92, "text": " Si conectamos esto con el panorama general de c\u00f3mo dise\u00f1amos sistemas, la compresi\u00f3n cognitiva tiene un precio alt\u00edsimo.", "tokens": [50708, 4909, 30458, 2151, 7433, 416, 806, 2462, 32988, 2674, 368, 12826, 3814, 2791, 2151, 48720, 11, 635, 715, 495, 2560, 11786, 270, 5931, 7066, 517, 46916, 4955, 49889, 13, 51018], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08504663951813228, "compression_ratio": 1.5018050541516246, "no_speech_prob": 8.706543298819813e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 72086, "start": 734.52, "end": 737.4, "text": " Crea lo que Flyson define como el experto fr\u00e1gil.", "tokens": [51048, 9549, 64, 450, 631, 25294, 3015, 6964, 2617, 806, 1086, 1353, 431, 21099, 388, 13, 51192], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08504663951813228, "compression_ratio": 1.5018050541516246, "no_speech_prob": 8.706543298819813e-12}, {"id": 103, "seek": 72086, "start": 738.2, "end": 742.86, "text": " Fr\u00e1gil. Pero si acaban de decir que son maestros, parecen invencibles en su campo.", "tokens": [51232, 1526, 21099, 388, 13, 9377, 1511, 13281, 282, 368, 10235, 631, 1872, 463, 377, 2635, 11, 7448, 13037, 294, 553, 537, 8806, 465, 459, 29691, 13, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08504663951813228, "compression_ratio": 1.5018050541516246, "no_speech_prob": 8.706543298819813e-12}, {"id": 104, "seek": 72086, "start": 743.26, "end": 746.64, "text": " Lo son, s\u00ed. Siempre y cuando las reglas del juego no cambien.", "tokens": [51485, 6130, 1872, 11, 8600, 13, 3559, 6516, 288, 7767, 2439, 1121, 7743, 1103, 21344, 572, 18751, 1053, 13, 51654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08504663951813228, "compression_ratio": 1.5018050541516246, "no_speech_prob": 8.706543298819813e-12}, {"id": 105, "seek": 74664, "start": 746.64, "end": 752.8199999999999, "text": " A ver, si a ese gran maestro de ajedrez le presentas un tablero donde las piezas han sido dispuestas al azar,", "tokens": [50365, 316, 1306, 11, 1511, 257, 10167, 9370, 463, 32389, 368, 17680, 292, 17693, 476, 1974, 296, 517, 4421, 1918, 78, 10488, 2439, 1730, 24561, 7276, 14444, 4920, 47794, 419, 7883, 289, 11, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06542673110961914, "compression_ratio": 1.603448275862069, "no_speech_prob": 8.707866892831984e-12}, {"id": 106, "seek": 74664, "start": 753.18, "end": 758.9399999999999, "text": " de maneras que jam\u00e1s ocurrir\u00edan en una partida con reglas reales, su rendimiento colapsa estrepitosamente.", "tokens": [50692, 368, 587, 6985, 631, 7872, 2490, 26430, 10949, 11084, 465, 2002, 644, 2887, 416, 1121, 7743, 957, 279, 11, 459, 6125, 14007, 1173, 2382, 64, 871, 19919, 11343, 3439, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06542673110961914, "compression_ratio": 1.603448275862069, "no_speech_prob": 8.707866892831984e-12}, {"id": 107, "seek": 74664, "start": 759.28, "end": 760.8, "text": " Vuelve a ser casi un novato.", "tokens": [50997, 691, 3483, 303, 257, 816, 22567, 517, 23883, 2513, 13, 51073], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06542673110961914, "compression_ratio": 1.603448275862069, "no_speech_prob": 8.707866892831984e-12}, {"id": 108, "seek": 74664, "start": 761.1999999999999, "end": 766.9, "text": " Exacto. Como su cerebro comprimi\u00f3 la historia bas\u00e1ndose estrictamente en las reglas del ajedrez convencional,", "tokens": [51093, 7199, 78, 13, 11913, 459, 11643, 9120, 715, 5565, 7138, 635, 18385, 987, 18606, 541, 871, 3740, 3439, 465, 2439, 1121, 7743, 1103, 17680, 292, 17693, 7158, 42395, 11, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06542673110961914, "compression_ratio": 1.603448275862069, "no_speech_prob": 8.707866892831984e-12}, {"id": 109, "seek": 74664, "start": 767.38, "end": 773.08, "text": " al alterar el entorno de esa manera, ya no tiene la estructura hist\u00f3rica, el paso a paso para adaptarse.", "tokens": [51402, 419, 11337, 289, 806, 948, 21998, 368, 11342, 13913, 11, 2478, 572, 7066, 635, 43935, 2991, 33196, 15192, 11, 806, 29212, 257, 29212, 1690, 6231, 11668, 13, 51687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06542673110961914, "compression_ratio": 1.603448275862069, "no_speech_prob": 8.707866892831984e-12}, {"id": 110, "seek": 77308, "start": 773.08, "end": 778.44, "text": " Comprimi\u00f3 tanto la ruta que si hay un desv\u00edo imprevisto, digamos, no sabe c\u00f3mo recalcular.", "tokens": [50365, 2432, 1424, 332, 7138, 10331, 635, 367, 12093, 631, 1511, 4842, 517, 730, 85, 20492, 704, 40382, 9334, 11, 36430, 11, 572, 12275, 12826, 850, 304, 17792, 13, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09757420389275802, "compression_ratio": 1.4608294930875576, "no_speech_prob": 8.276481930358237e-12}, {"id": 111, "seek": 77308, "start": 778.6800000000001, "end": 786.1, "text": " Entonces, el conocimiento de un experto fr\u00e1gil es incre\u00edblemente r\u00e1pido y eficiente en su estado actual.", "tokens": [50645, 15097, 11, 806, 15871, 14007, 368, 517, 1086, 1353, 431, 21099, 388, 785, 46202, 638, 4082, 24893, 288, 308, 26863, 465, 459, 18372, 3539, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09757420389275802, "compression_ratio": 1.4608294930875576, "no_speech_prob": 8.276481930358237e-12}, {"id": 112, "seek": 77308, "start": 786.76, "end": 792.82, "text": " Pero si el futuro inmediato no coincide con el pasado que su cerebro comprimi\u00f3, se rompe.", "tokens": [51049, 9377, 1511, 806, 23953, 294, 3130, 2513, 572, 13001, 482, 416, 806, 24794, 631, 459, 11643, 9120, 715, 5565, 7138, 11, 369, 7438, 494, 13, 51352], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09757420389275802, "compression_ratio": 1.4608294930875576, "no_speech_prob": 8.276481930358237e-12}, {"id": 113, "seek": 77308, "start": 793.1800000000001, "end": 794.1600000000001, "text": " Se quiebra por completo.", "tokens": [51370, 1100, 421, 414, 6198, 1515, 40135, 13, 51419], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09757420389275802, "compression_ratio": 1.4608294930875576, "no_speech_prob": 8.276481930358237e-12}, {"id": 114, "seek": 79416, "start": 794.16, "end": 799.52, "text": " Y me encanta que usemos la palabra futuro, porque si la historia es el pasado,", "tokens": [50365, 398, 385, 47597, 631, 764, 3415, 635, 31702, 23953, 11, 4021, 1511, 635, 18385, 785, 806, 24794, 11, 50633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08561930530949642, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 9.943373381615661e-12}, {"id": 115, "seek": 79416, "start": 799.8199999999999, "end": 805.98, "text": " el siguiente salto en el an\u00e1lisis de las fuentes es hacia lo que el autor llama la continuaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50648, 806, 25666, 1845, 1353, 465, 806, 44113, 28436, 368, 2439, 8536, 9240, 785, 21365, 450, 631, 806, 19510, 23272, 635, 2993, 3482, 13, 50956], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08561930530949642, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 9.943373381615661e-12}, {"id": 116, "seek": 79416, "start": 806.54, "end": 812.92, "text": " O sea, el concepto de continuaci\u00f3n, es decir, dejar de mirar hacia atr\u00e1s y empezar a mirar hacia adelante.", "tokens": [50984, 422, 4158, 11, 806, 3410, 78, 368, 2993, 3482, 11, 785, 10235, 11, 24391, 368, 3149, 289, 21365, 22906, 288, 31168, 257, 3149, 289, 21365, 40214, 13, 51303], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08561930530949642, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 9.943373381615661e-12}, {"id": 117, "seek": 81292, "start": 812.92, "end": 816.36, "text": " Y te digo, ese es el eje central de toda la teor\u00eda.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 535, 22990, 11, 10167, 785, 806, 39564, 5777, 368, 11687, 635, 40238, 2686, 13, 50537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08742393146861684, "compression_ratio": 1.5485232067510548, "no_speech_prob": 9.341621226566232e-12}, {"id": 118, "seek": 81292, "start": 817.2199999999999, "end": 822.62, "text": " El valor real de un sistema, ya sea un c\u00e9lebre humano, un bloque de c\u00f3digo o incluso una instituci\u00f3n,", "tokens": [50580, 2699, 15367, 957, 368, 517, 13245, 11, 2478, 4158, 517, 30560, 306, 2672, 30985, 11, 517, 41592, 368, 44195, 277, 24018, 2002, 4348, 30813, 11, 50850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08742393146861684, "compression_ratio": 1.5485232067510548, "no_speech_prob": 9.341621226566232e-12}, {"id": 119, "seek": 81292, "start": 823.12, "end": 825.66, "text": " no se mide por cu\u00e1nta informaci\u00f3n retiene del pasado.", "tokens": [50875, 572, 369, 275, 482, 1515, 44256, 64, 21660, 1533, 10174, 1103, 24794, 13, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08742393146861684, "compression_ratio": 1.5485232067510548, "no_speech_prob": 9.341621226566232e-12}, {"id": 120, "seek": 81292, "start": 826.1999999999999, "end": 831.18, "text": " Se mide por su continuaci\u00f3n, que se define como el espacio total de futuros posibles", "tokens": [51029, 1100, 275, 482, 1515, 459, 2993, 3482, 11, 631, 369, 6964, 2617, 806, 33845, 3217, 368, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 51278], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08742393146861684, "compression_ratio": 1.5485232067510548, "no_speech_prob": 9.341621226566232e-12}, {"id": 121, "seek": 81292, "start": 831.18, "end": 834.8199999999999, "text": " que el sistema a\u00fan es capaz de alcanzar desde su posici\u00f3n actual.", "tokens": [51278, 631, 806, 13245, 31676, 785, 35453, 368, 50200, 289, 10188, 459, 46595, 3539, 13, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08742393146861684, "compression_ratio": 1.5485232067510548, "no_speech_prob": 9.341621226566232e-12}, {"id": 122, "seek": 83482, "start": 834.82, "end": 840.8000000000001, "text": " Para aterrizar esto visualmente, el texto hace una distinci\u00f3n crucial entre dos tipos de errores", "tokens": [50365, 11107, 257, 391, 24959, 289, 7433, 5056, 4082, 11, 806, 35503, 10032, 2002, 1483, 259, 5687, 11462, 3962, 4491, 37105, 368, 45935, 495, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07043217790537867, "compression_ratio": 1.53125, "no_speech_prob": 9.675118345375822e-12}, {"id": 123, "seek": 83482, "start": 840.8000000000001, "end": 846.86, "text": " que cometemos al comprimir informaci\u00f3n, que son el d\u00e9ficit de continuaci\u00f3n y el d\u00e9ficit ontol\u00f3gico.", "tokens": [50664, 631, 33696, 4485, 419, 715, 5565, 347, 21660, 11, 631, 1872, 806, 2795, 1786, 270, 368, 2993, 3482, 288, 806, 2795, 1786, 270, 6592, 27629, 2789, 13, 50967], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07043217790537867, "compression_ratio": 1.53125, "no_speech_prob": 9.675118345375822e-12}, {"id": 124, "seek": 83482, "start": 847.2, "end": 848.34, "text": " Dos conceptos clave.", "tokens": [50984, 33474, 3410, 329, 596, 946, 13, 51041], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07043217790537867, "compression_ratio": 1.53125, "no_speech_prob": 9.675118345375822e-12}, {"id": 125, "seek": 83482, "start": 848.74, "end": 853.5200000000001, "text": " S\u00ed. Y leyendo esto, se me ocurri\u00f3 una analog\u00eda para no perdernos.", "tokens": [51061, 12375, 13, 398, 27786, 3999, 7433, 11, 369, 385, 26430, 44802, 2002, 16660, 2686, 1690, 572, 26971, 16751, 13, 51300], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07043217790537867, "compression_ratio": 1.53125, "no_speech_prob": 9.675118345375822e-12}, {"id": 126, "seek": 83482, "start": 854.3000000000001, "end": 860.4000000000001, "text": " Pensemos en cuando uno empaca una maleta a toda velocidad, para ir, no s\u00e9, de viaje a la monta\u00f1a.", "tokens": [51339, 430, 1288, 3415, 465, 7767, 8526, 4012, 6628, 2002, 2806, 7664, 257, 11687, 50143, 11, 1690, 3418, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 368, 48932, 257, 635, 8143, 64, 12150, 13, 51644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07043217790537867, "compression_ratio": 1.53125, "no_speech_prob": 9.675118345375822e-12}, {"id": 127, "seek": 86040, "start": 860.4, "end": 867.9399999999999, "text": " Comprimo mi proceso de decisi\u00f3n y decido no llevar un su\u00e9ter extra para que la maleta cierre de una vez por todes.", "tokens": [50365, 2432, 1424, 6934, 2752, 29314, 368, 18206, 2560, 288, 979, 2925, 572, 30374, 517, 459, 526, 391, 2857, 1690, 631, 635, 2806, 7664, 39769, 265, 368, 2002, 5715, 1515, 4352, 279, 13, 50742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 128, "seek": 86040, "start": 868.56, "end": 871.72, "text": " Llego a la monta\u00f1a, hace un fr\u00edo terrible y me congelo.", "tokens": [50773, 441, 306, 1571, 257, 635, 8143, 64, 12150, 11, 10032, 517, 431, 20492, 6237, 288, 385, 416, 10345, 78, 13, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 129, "seek": 86040, "start": 872.34, "end": 874.3, "text": " Eso ser\u00eda un d\u00e9ficit de continuaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50962, 27795, 23679, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 368, 2993, 3482, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 130, "seek": 86040, "start": 874.9399999999999, "end": 878.34, "text": " Tom\u00e9 un riesgo calculado, perd\u00ed una opci\u00f3n futura de abrigarme,", "tokens": [51092, 5041, 526, 517, 23932, 1571, 4322, 1573, 11, 12611, 870, 2002, 999, 5687, 1877, 2991, 368, 410, 7065, 35890, 11, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 131, "seek": 86040, "start": 878.86, "end": 880.78, "text": " pero entiendo perfectamente que sali\u00f3 mal.", "tokens": [51288, 4768, 948, 7304, 2176, 3439, 631, 1845, 7138, 2806, 13, 51384], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 132, "seek": 86040, "start": 881.14, "end": 882.3, "text": " S\u00e9 que me falta un su\u00e9ter.", "tokens": [51402, 49556, 631, 385, 22111, 517, 459, 526, 391, 13, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 133, "seek": 86040, "start": 882.54, "end": 883.4, "text": " Es un gran ejemplo.", "tokens": [51472, 2313, 517, 9370, 13358, 13, 51515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 134, "seek": 86040, "start": 884.12, "end": 888.8, "text": " Y para llevar esa idea de la maleta a un paso m\u00e1s all\u00e1, hacia el segundo concepto,", "tokens": [51551, 398, 1690, 30374, 11342, 1558, 368, 635, 2806, 7664, 257, 517, 29212, 3573, 30642, 11, 21365, 806, 17954, 3410, 78, 11, 51785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11557529054839036, "compression_ratio": 1.5807560137457044, "no_speech_prob": 8.91442562128697e-12}, {"id": 135, "seek": 88880, "start": 888.8, "end": 893.52, "text": " un d\u00e9ficit ontol\u00f3gico ser\u00eda una falla catastr\u00f3fica de comprensi\u00f3n b\u00e1sica.", "tokens": [50365, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 6592, 27629, 2789, 23679, 2002, 2100, 64, 19754, 11721, 1786, 64, 368, 715, 1095, 82, 2560, 25545, 2262, 13, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 136, "seek": 88880, "start": 894.1999999999999, "end": 896.26, "text": " Ser\u00eda como si, al empacar a toda prisa,", "tokens": [50635, 4210, 2686, 2617, 1511, 11, 419, 4012, 326, 289, 257, 11687, 582, 3837, 11, 50738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 137, "seek": 88880, "start": 896.64, "end": 901.52, "text": " comprimieras tanto la idea del viaje que tu cerebro directamente elimina el concepto mismo de vestirse.", "tokens": [50757, 715, 5565, 811, 296, 10331, 635, 1558, 1103, 48932, 631, 2604, 11643, 9120, 46230, 24333, 1426, 806, 3410, 78, 12461, 368, 15814, 36097, 13, 51001], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 138, "seek": 88880, "start": 901.8399999999999, "end": 902.3, "text": " \u00a1Ay, Dios!", "tokens": [51017, 6514, 31983, 11, 21838, 0, 51040], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 139, "seek": 88880, "start": 902.4399999999999, "end": 904.0999999999999, "text": " Llegas a la monta\u00f1a sin pantalones.", "tokens": [51047, 441, 6363, 296, 257, 635, 8143, 64, 12150, 3343, 14869, 304, 2213, 13, 51130], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 140, "seek": 88880, "start": 904.5999999999999, "end": 906.4, "text": " Pero ni siquiera sabes que est\u00e1s desnudo,", "tokens": [51155, 9377, 3867, 1511, 35134, 37790, 631, 24389, 730, 77, 6207, 11, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 141, "seek": 88880, "start": 906.8, "end": 911.8599999999999, "text": " porque la distinci\u00f3n mental entre estar vestido y no estarlo desapareci\u00f3 por completo de tu sistema operativo.", "tokens": [51265, 4021, 635, 1483, 259, 5687, 4973, 3962, 8755, 15814, 2925, 288, 572, 8755, 752, 42316, 19609, 1515, 40135, 368, 2604, 13245, 2208, 18586, 13, 51518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 142, "seek": 88880, "start": 912.4799999999999, "end": 914.6999999999999, "text": " El sistema simplemente no sabe que perdi\u00f3 algo.", "tokens": [51549, 2699, 13245, 33190, 572, 12275, 631, 680, 4504, 812, 8655, 13, 51660], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 143, "seek": 88880, "start": 915.26, "end": 916.3399999999999, "text": " No hay conciencia del error.", "tokens": [51688, 883, 4842, 416, 537, 10974, 1103, 6713, 13, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11076200397965176, "compression_ratio": 1.5794392523364487, "no_speech_prob": 6.395853031221366e-12}, {"id": 144, "seek": 91634, "start": 916.34, "end": 923.12, "text": " Y cuando aplicamos esto a sistemas reales y no a maletas, las consecuencias son impactantes.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 7767, 18221, 2151, 7433, 257, 48720, 957, 279, 288, 572, 257, 2806, 35120, 11, 2439, 40526, 7801, 12046, 1872, 2712, 9327, 13, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 145, "seek": 91634, "start": 923.5, "end": 925.02, "text": " Volviendo a Git por un segundo,", "tokens": [50723, 8911, 85, 7304, 257, 16939, 1515, 517, 17954, 11, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 146, "seek": 91634, "start": 925.58, "end": 931.44, "text": " este sistema borra la historia de cu\u00e1ntas veces presionaste la tecla de borrar o si te equivocaste de letra.", "tokens": [50827, 4065, 13245, 14828, 424, 635, 18385, 368, 44256, 296, 17054, 1183, 313, 9079, 635, 535, 46265, 368, 14828, 5352, 277, 1511, 535, 48726, 905, 9079, 368, 718, 424, 13, 51120], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 147, "seek": 91634, "start": 931.64, "end": 931.94, "text": " Claro.", "tokens": [51130, 33380, 13, 51145], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 148, "seek": 91634, "start": 932.0600000000001, "end": 935.0600000000001, "text": " Eso es un d\u00e9ficit de continuaci\u00f3n baj\u00edsimo,", "tokens": [51151, 27795, 785, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 368, 2993, 3482, 23589, 49889, 11, 51301], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 149, "seek": 91634, "start": 935.6, "end": 940.44, "text": " porque al futuro de la programaci\u00f3n no le importan lo m\u00e1s m\u00ednimo tus errores de tipeo.", "tokens": [51328, 4021, 419, 23953, 368, 635, 1461, 3482, 572, 476, 974, 282, 450, 3573, 47393, 20647, 45935, 495, 368, 256, 6527, 78, 13, 51570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08081125998282218, "compression_ratio": 1.512, "no_speech_prob": 9.638608487738676e-12}, {"id": 150, "seek": 94044, "start": 940.44, "end": 943.74, "text": " Pero si hablamos de un archivo legal de un tribunal,", "tokens": [50365, 9377, 1511, 26280, 2151, 368, 517, 3912, 6340, 5089, 368, 517, 15039, 33304, 11, 50530], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843379845779934, "compression_ratio": 1.4495412844036697, "no_speech_prob": 9.378063429987815e-12}, {"id": 151, "seek": 94044, "start": 944.2800000000001, "end": 949.1600000000001, "text": " este conserva firmas f\u00edsicas, sellos y metadatos notariales exactos,", "tokens": [50557, 4065, 9704, 64, 6174, 296, 27538, 9150, 11, 3607, 329, 288, 1131, 345, 26818, 406, 44745, 279, 1900, 329, 11, 50801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843379845779934, "compression_ratio": 1.4495412844036697, "no_speech_prob": 9.378063429987815e-12}, {"id": 152, "seek": 94044, "start": 949.36, "end": 953.3800000000001, "text": " porque est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ado espec\u00edficamente para un futuro de auditor\u00edas.", "tokens": [50811, 4021, 3192, 3814, 2791, 1573, 32741, 3439, 1690, 517, 23953, 368, 33970, 10025, 13, 51012], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843379845779934, "compression_ratio": 1.4495412844036697, "no_speech_prob": 9.378063429987815e-12}, {"id": 153, "seek": 94044, "start": 954.0200000000001, "end": 957.8000000000001, "text": " Perder una firma en ese contexto ser\u00eda un d\u00e9ficit ontol\u00f3gico.", "tokens": [51044, 3026, 1068, 2002, 12159, 1696, 465, 10167, 47685, 23679, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 6592, 27629, 2789, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843379845779934, "compression_ratio": 1.4495412844036697, "no_speech_prob": 9.378063429987815e-12}, {"id": 154, "seek": 94044, "start": 958.22, "end": 961.2800000000001, "text": " El documento perder\u00eda su calidad del legal por completo.", "tokens": [51254, 2699, 4166, 78, 26971, 2686, 459, 42955, 1103, 5089, 1515, 40135, 13, 51407], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10843379845779934, "compression_ratio": 1.4495412844036697, "no_speech_prob": 9.378063429987815e-12}, {"id": 155, "seek": 96128, "start": 961.28, "end": 965.24, "text": " Y si conectamos esto con el panorama general,", "tokens": [50365, 398, 1511, 30458, 2151, 7433, 416, 806, 2462, 32988, 2674, 11, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 156, "seek": 96128, "start": 965.74, "end": 970.98, "text": " el texto usa esta misma m\u00e9trica de los d\u00e9ficits para explicar desastres en el mundo acad\u00e9mico,", "tokens": [50588, 806, 35503, 29909, 5283, 24946, 20275, 15192, 368, 1750, 2795, 1786, 1208, 1690, 26682, 730, 525, 495, 465, 806, 7968, 5558, 4011, 2789, 11, 50850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 157, "seek": 96128, "start": 971.4, "end": 973.8399999999999, "text": " como la famosa crisis de replicaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica.", "tokens": [50871, 2617, 635, 1087, 6447, 5869, 368, 3248, 299, 3482, 37053, 64, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 158, "seek": 96128, "start": 973.98, "end": 978.16, "text": " Claro, cuando decenas de estudios famosos, sobre todo de psicolog\u00eda,", "tokens": [51000, 33380, 11, 7767, 979, 11581, 368, 13542, 2717, 1087, 33894, 11, 5473, 5149, 368, 38609, 29987, 11, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 159, "seek": 96128, "start": 978.4399999999999, "end": 981.36, "text": " no pudieron ser replicados en laboratorios modernos.", "tokens": [51223, 572, 14166, 14440, 816, 3248, 299, 4181, 465, 5938, 1639, 2717, 4363, 329, 13, 51369], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 160, "seek": 96128, "start": 981.9599999999999, "end": 984.36, "text": " Siempre se asumi\u00f3 que era fraude o mala ciencia.", "tokens": [51399, 3559, 6516, 369, 382, 449, 7138, 631, 4249, 6600, 2303, 277, 37508, 269, 30592, 13, 51519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 161, "seek": 96128, "start": 984.68, "end": 984.9399999999999, "text": " No.", "tokens": [51535, 883, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15379993335620776, "compression_ratio": 1.5458333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 9.488294698545285e-12}, {"id": 162, "seek": 98494, "start": 984.94, "end": 987.36, "text": " Y, a ver, algunos lo fueron, sin duda.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 11, 257, 1306, 11, 21078, 450, 28739, 11, 3343, 43881, 13, 50486], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 163, "seek": 98494, "start": 987.94, "end": 993.3800000000001, "text": " Pero la gran mayor\u00eda fall\u00f3 por un d\u00e9ficit ontol\u00f3gico en el formato de publicaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica en s\u00ed.", "tokens": [50515, 9377, 635, 9370, 35342, 2100, 812, 1515, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 6592, 27629, 2789, 465, 806, 1254, 2513, 368, 1908, 3482, 37053, 64, 465, 8600, 13, 50787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 164, "seek": 98494, "start": 994.24, "end": 999.9200000000001, "text": " En su af\u00e1n por comprimir la informaci\u00f3n metodol\u00f3gica para que cupieran las p\u00e1ginas limitadas de una revista impresa,", "tokens": [50830, 2193, 459, 3238, 7200, 1515, 715, 5565, 347, 635, 21660, 1131, 378, 27629, 2262, 1690, 631, 4414, 38516, 2439, 40639, 1494, 296, 4948, 6872, 368, 2002, 3698, 5236, 35672, 64, 11, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 165, "seek": 98494, "start": 1000.36, "end": 1005.0200000000001, "text": " los cient\u00edficos recortaban secciones enteras sobre c\u00f3mo prepararon el experimento.", "tokens": [51136, 1750, 37053, 329, 850, 477, 18165, 907, 23469, 3242, 296, 5473, 12826, 8231, 6372, 806, 5120, 78, 13, 51369], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 166, "seek": 98494, "start": 1005.0400000000001, "end": 1006.0200000000001, "text": " Para ahorrar espacio.", "tokens": [51370, 11107, 44249, 5352, 33845, 13, 51419], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 167, "seek": 98494, "start": 1006.4000000000001, "end": 1006.8800000000001, "text": " Exacto.", "tokens": [51438, 7199, 78, 13, 51462], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 168, "seek": 98494, "start": 1007.3800000000001, "end": 1010.74, "text": " Cre\u00edan que estaban eliminando detalles irrelevantes, pura entrop\u00eda,", "tokens": [51487, 9549, 11084, 631, 36713, 7892, 1806, 1141, 37927, 28682, 279, 11, 1864, 64, 948, 1513, 2686, 11, 51655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10531838983297348, "compression_ratio": 1.560553633217993, "no_speech_prob": 8.373630781821628e-12}, {"id": 169, "seek": 101074, "start": 1010.74, "end": 1013.5600000000001, "text": " pero en realidad estaban destruyendo las continuaciones,", "tokens": [50365, 4768, 465, 25635, 36713, 34235, 88, 3999, 2439, 2993, 9188, 11, 50506], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 170, "seek": 101074, "start": 1014.0, "end": 1019.12, "text": " los puentes que un cient\u00edfico del futuro iba a necesitar para repetir el experimento bajo las mismas condiciones.", "tokens": [50528, 1750, 2362, 9240, 631, 517, 37053, 78, 1103, 23953, 33423, 257, 11909, 3981, 1690, 13645, 347, 806, 5120, 78, 30139, 2439, 23220, 296, 45960, 13, 50784], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 171, "seek": 101074, "start": 1019.66, "end": 1021.82, "text": " El sistema perdi\u00f3 distinciones vitales,", "tokens": [50811, 2699, 13245, 680, 4504, 812, 1483, 4647, 5411, 11707, 279, 11, 50919], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 172, "seek": 101074, "start": 1022.2, "end": 1026.78, "text": " y la comunidad ni siquiera se dio cuenta hasta d\u00e9cadas despu\u00e9s, cuando todo empez\u00f3 a colapsar.", "tokens": [50938, 288, 635, 35695, 3867, 1511, 35134, 369, 31965, 17868, 10764, 9198, 6872, 15283, 11, 7767, 5149, 18730, 812, 257, 1173, 2382, 289, 13, 51167], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 173, "seek": 101074, "start": 1027.02, "end": 1027.66, "text": " \u00a1Qu\u00e9 locura!", "tokens": [51179, 6514, 15137, 1628, 2991, 0, 51211], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 174, "seek": 101074, "start": 1028.18, "end": 1034.5, "text": " Hay otro ejemplo en la documentaci\u00f3n que me pareci\u00f3, digo, de una claridad aterradora para la vida diaria,", "tokens": [51237, 8721, 11921, 13358, 465, 635, 4166, 3482, 631, 385, 7448, 19609, 11, 22990, 11, 368, 2002, 6093, 4580, 257, 391, 6206, 3252, 1690, 635, 7644, 1026, 9831, 11, 51553], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 175, "seek": 101074, "start": 1035.08, "end": 1038.52, "text": " y es el del sem\u00e1foro inteligente que mencionamos justo en la introducci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51582, 288, 785, 806, 1103, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 44300, 1576, 631, 37030, 2151, 40534, 465, 635, 2814, 14735, 13, 51754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09775554269984149, "compression_ratio": 1.61198738170347, "no_speech_prob": 8.053388685091978e-12}, {"id": 176, "seek": 103852, "start": 1038.52, "end": 1045.18, "text": " El momento exacto en que un sem\u00e1foro decide que ya no necesita recordar a un peat\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50365, 2699, 9333, 1900, 78, 465, 631, 517, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 4536, 631, 2478, 572, 45485, 2136, 289, 257, 517, 520, 267, 1801, 13, 50698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 177, "seek": 103852, "start": 1045.3799999999999, "end": 1045.78, "text": " Oh, s\u00ed.", "tokens": [50708, 876, 11, 8600, 13, 50728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 178, "seek": 103852, "start": 1046.3, "end": 1051.92, "text": " Es un caso de estudio perfecto sobre c\u00f3mo colapsar el estado de manera primatura destruye futuros posibles.", "tokens": [50754, 2313, 517, 9666, 368, 44286, 2176, 78, 5473, 12826, 1173, 2382, 289, 806, 18372, 368, 13913, 2886, 19660, 34235, 1200, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 13, 51035], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 179, "seek": 103852, "start": 1052.6, "end": 1053.84, "text": " Tienes un sem\u00e1foro inteligente.", "tokens": [51069, 314, 1053, 279, 517, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 44300, 1576, 13, 51131], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 180, "seek": 103852, "start": 1054.3, "end": 1056.16, "text": " Un peat\u00f3n oprima el bot\u00f3n para cruzar.", "tokens": [51154, 1156, 520, 267, 1801, 999, 81, 4775, 806, 10592, 1801, 1690, 5140, 26236, 13, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 181, "seek": 103852, "start": 1056.58, "end": 1060.66, "text": " El sistema registra un bit de informaci\u00f3n, o sea, sabe que hay alguien esperando.", "tokens": [51268, 2699, 13245, 11376, 424, 517, 857, 368, 21660, 11, 277, 4158, 11, 12275, 631, 4842, 25814, 46587, 13, 51472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 182, "seek": 103852, "start": 1060.9, "end": 1061.22, "text": " Aj\u00e1.", "tokens": [51484, 25862, 842, 13, 51500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08110661713973336, "compression_ratio": 1.5102880658436213, "no_speech_prob": 8.539159830622811e-12}, {"id": 183, "seek": 106122, "start": 1061.22, "end": 1064.58, "text": " Pero como el sem\u00e1foro ya estaba en rojo para los autos de todas formas,", "tokens": [50365, 9377, 2617, 806, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 2478, 17544, 465, 744, 5134, 1690, 1750, 1476, 329, 368, 10906, 33463, 11, 50533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 184, "seek": 106122, "start": 1064.94, "end": 1068.84, "text": " el sistema, operando bajo la l\u00f3gica est\u00e1tica del presente, asume,", "tokens": [50551, 806, 13245, 11, 2208, 1806, 30139, 635, 48475, 2262, 3192, 83, 2262, 1103, 28709, 11, 382, 2540, 11, 50746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 185, "seek": 106122, "start": 1069.32, "end": 1071.6200000000001, "text": " eh, bueno, los autos ya est\u00e1n detenidos ahora mismo,", "tokens": [50770, 7670, 11, 11974, 11, 1750, 1476, 329, 2478, 10368, 1141, 268, 7895, 9923, 12461, 11, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 186, "seek": 106122, "start": 1071.88, "end": 1074.46, "text": " as\u00ed que el peat\u00f3n cruzar\u00e1 de todos modos en este ciclo.", "tokens": [50898, 8582, 631, 806, 520, 267, 1801, 5140, 89, 21534, 368, 6321, 1072, 329, 465, 4065, 27464, 752, 13, 51027], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 187, "seek": 106122, "start": 1074.74, "end": 1076.74, "text": " Y para ahorrar memoria, borra el bit.", "tokens": [51041, 398, 1690, 44249, 5352, 1334, 8172, 11, 14828, 424, 806, 857, 13, 51141], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 188, "seek": 106122, "start": 1076.94, "end": 1079.8, "text": " Claro, porque desde el punto de vista del estado actual,", "tokens": [51151, 33380, 11, 4021, 10188, 806, 14326, 368, 22553, 1103, 18372, 3539, 11, 51294], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 189, "seek": 106122, "start": 1080.08, "end": 1083.5, "text": " parece totalmente redundante mantener esa memoria viva.", "tokens": [51308, 14120, 30865, 27830, 2879, 42759, 11342, 1334, 8172, 371, 5931, 13, 51479], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 190, "seek": 106122, "start": 1083.96, "end": 1084.76, "text": " Ya est\u00e1n en rojo.", "tokens": [51502, 6080, 10368, 465, 744, 5134, 13, 51542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09366926046518179, "compression_ratio": 1.65234375, "no_speech_prob": 8.539382742589474e-12}, {"id": 191, "seek": 108476, "start": 1084.76, "end": 1085.44, "text": " Exacto.", "tokens": [50365, 7199, 78, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 192, "seek": 108476, "start": 1085.66, "end": 1089.6, "text": " Pero \u00bfqu\u00e9 pasa si en ese preciso microsegundo un veh\u00edculo de emergencia,", "tokens": [50410, 9377, 3841, 16412, 20260, 1511, 465, 10167, 30109, 3123, 37841, 70, 6043, 517, 4221, 34365, 368, 33983, 2755, 11, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 193, "seek": 108476, "start": 1089.8, "end": 1093.52, "text": " digamos una ambulancia, env\u00eda una se\u00f1al de interrupci\u00f3n al sem\u00e1foro", "tokens": [50617, 36430, 2002, 21574, 22862, 11, 2267, 2686, 2002, 13830, 304, 368, 728, 11976, 5687, 419, 4361, 842, 2994, 78, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 194, "seek": 108476, "start": 1093.52, "end": 1095.56, "text": " para cambiar las luces a verde y pasar r\u00e1pido?", "tokens": [50803, 1690, 37738, 2439, 10438, 887, 257, 29653, 288, 25344, 24893, 30, 50905], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 195, "seek": 108476, "start": 1095.74, "end": 1096.3799999999999, "text": " Ay, no.", "tokens": [50914, 9081, 11, 572, 13, 50946], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 196, "seek": 108476, "start": 1096.62, "end": 1099.08, "text": " La luz cambia, la ambulancia pasa a toda velocidad,", "tokens": [50958, 2369, 20671, 18751, 654, 11, 635, 21574, 22862, 20260, 257, 11687, 50143, 11, 51081], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 197, "seek": 108476, "start": 1099.66, "end": 1101.62, "text": " y cuando el sistema retoma su ciclo normal,", "tokens": [51110, 288, 7767, 806, 13245, 1533, 6440, 459, 27464, 752, 2710, 11, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 198, "seek": 108476, "start": 1101.94, "end": 1104.0, "text": " el peat\u00f3n ha dejado de existir para la m\u00e1quina.", "tokens": [51224, 806, 520, 267, 1801, 324, 21259, 1573, 368, 2514, 347, 1690, 635, 49360, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 199, "seek": 108476, "start": 1104.18, "end": 1105.54, "text": " Porque borr\u00f3 la solicitud.", "tokens": [51336, 11287, 14828, 11721, 635, 23665, 21875, 13, 51404], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 200, "seek": 108476, "start": 1106.06, "end": 1106.3, "text": " S\u00ed.", "tokens": [51430, 12375, 13, 51442], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 201, "seek": 108476, "start": 1106.72, "end": 1110.82, "text": " Como borr\u00f3 la historia de la solicitud asumiendo un futuro est\u00e1tico que nunca ocurri\u00f3,", "tokens": [51463, 11913, 14828, 11721, 635, 18385, 368, 635, 23665, 21875, 382, 449, 7304, 517, 23953, 3192, 83, 2789, 631, 13768, 26430, 44802, 11, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 202, "seek": 108476, "start": 1110.82, "end": 1113.84, "text": " el sistema sufre un d\u00e9ficit ontol\u00f3gico masivo", "tokens": [51668, 806, 13245, 459, 19325, 517, 2795, 1786, 270, 6592, 27629, 2789, 2300, 6340, 51819], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1161012416932641, "compression_ratio": 1.595166163141994, "no_speech_prob": 7.622898839931835e-12}, {"id": 203, "seek": 111384, "start": 1113.84, "end": 1117.78, "text": " y la persona se queda en la acera esperando para siempre a que la luz cambie.", "tokens": [50365, 288, 635, 12184, 369, 23314, 465, 635, 696, 1663, 46587, 1690, 12758, 257, 631, 635, 20671, 1945, 7392, 13, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 204, "seek": 111384, "start": 1118.08, "end": 1119.1399999999999, "text": " Es escalofriante.", "tokens": [50577, 2313, 17871, 2670, 470, 2879, 13, 50630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 205, "seek": 111384, "start": 1119.6399999999999, "end": 1124.8, "text": " Y frente a esta fragilidad sist\u00e9mica en nuestra tecnolog\u00eda y nuestras instituciones,", "tokens": [50655, 398, 19873, 257, 5283, 9241, 388, 4580, 10555, 4011, 2262, 465, 16825, 48055, 288, 32809, 4348, 46649, 11, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 206, "seek": 111384, "start": 1125.28, "end": 1128.02, "text": " la reacci\u00f3n miseral humana siempre es la misma, \u00bfverdad?", "tokens": [50937, 635, 319, 49354, 3346, 2790, 1952, 64, 12758, 785, 635, 24946, 11, 3841, 331, 20034, 30, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 207, "seek": 111384, "start": 1128.4199999999998, "end": 1133.72, "text": " Decimos, necesitamos m\u00e1s reglas, necesitamos m\u00e1s leyes, m\u00e1s redundancia,", "tokens": [51094, 12427, 8372, 11, 38661, 2151, 3573, 1121, 7743, 11, 38661, 2151, 3573, 476, 2346, 11, 3573, 27830, 22862, 11, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 208, "seek": 111384, "start": 1134.1799999999998, "end": 1136.86, "text": " lo cual nos mete de lleno en la siguiente secci\u00f3n del texto,", "tokens": [51382, 450, 10911, 3269, 21245, 368, 4849, 5808, 465, 635, 25666, 907, 5687, 1103, 35503, 11, 51516], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 209, "seek": 111384, "start": 1136.86, "end": 1140.76, "text": " el concepto de la ecolog\u00eda de las restricciones.", "tokens": [51516, 806, 3410, 78, 368, 635, 11437, 29987, 368, 2439, 1472, 1341, 23469, 13, 51711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 210, "seek": 111384, "start": 1141.22, "end": 1142.6, "text": " Un t\u00edtulo tremendo.", "tokens": [51734, 1156, 43399, 7813, 3999, 13, 51803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15244698339654494, "compression_ratio": 1.6423357664233578, "no_speech_prob": 1.0665759074546255e-11}, {"id": 211, "seek": 114260, "start": 1142.6, "end": 1143.28, "text": " S\u00ed.", "tokens": [50365, 12375, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 212, "seek": 114260, "start": 1143.6999999999998, "end": 1146.9599999999998, "text": " Si queremos proteger los futuros posibles, ponemos candados.", "tokens": [50420, 4909, 26813, 1742, 30744, 1750, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 11, 9224, 4485, 3955, 4181, 13, 50583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 213, "seek": 114260, "start": 1147.4599999999998, "end": 1151.06, "text": " Pero el autor analiza estas reglas corporativas o sist\u00e9micas", "tokens": [50608, 9377, 806, 19510, 2624, 13427, 13897, 1121, 7743, 6804, 35725, 277, 10555, 4011, 9150, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 214, "seek": 114260, "start": 1151.06, "end": 1155.34, "text": " como si fueran poblaciones de animalitos compitiendo en un ecosistema vivo.", "tokens": [50788, 2617, 1511, 17669, 282, 30548, 9188, 368, 5496, 11343, 715, 270, 7304, 465, 517, 11007, 468, 5619, 30689, 13, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 215, "seek": 114260, "start": 1155.76, "end": 1158.8, "text": " Y separa dos conceptos que solemos confundir todo el tiempo,", "tokens": [51023, 398, 3128, 64, 4491, 3410, 329, 631, 12321, 3415, 1497, 997, 347, 5149, 806, 11772, 11, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 216, "seek": 114260, "start": 1159.2199999999998, "end": 1161.6999999999998, "text": " que son viabilidad y diversidad.", "tokens": [51196, 631, 1872, 1932, 5177, 4580, 288, 6111, 4580, 13, 51320], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 217, "seek": 114260, "start": 1162.1, "end": 1164.6999999999998, "text": " Y esto plantea una pregunta importante para cualquier persona", "tokens": [51340, 398, 7433, 36829, 64, 2002, 24252, 9416, 1690, 21004, 12184, 51470], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 218, "seek": 114260, "start": 1164.6999999999998, "end": 1168.74, "text": " que dise\u00f1e protocolos de seguridad, software o pol\u00edticas p\u00fablicas.", "tokens": [51470, 631, 3814, 2791, 68, 10336, 329, 368, 35415, 11, 4722, 277, 45931, 15392, 296, 13, 51672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10329124483011537, "compression_ratio": 1.5656934306569343, "no_speech_prob": 9.524631083834834e-12}, {"id": 219, "seek": 116874, "start": 1168.74, "end": 1174.66, "text": " Tendemos a asumir casi ciegamente que apilar m\u00faltiples reglas de seguridad una encima de otra", "tokens": [50365, 314, 521, 4485, 257, 382, 449, 347, 22567, 269, 20408, 3439, 631, 1882, 2202, 275, 43447, 72, 2622, 1121, 7743, 368, 35415, 2002, 40265, 368, 13623, 50661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10529525889906773, "compression_ratio": 1.2432432432432432, "no_speech_prob": 9.487620758474868e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 116874, "start": 1174.66, "end": 1177.2, "text": " autom\u00e1ticamente reduce el riesgo de fallo.", "tokens": [50661, 3553, 7656, 23653, 5407, 806, 23932, 1571, 368, 2100, 78, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10529525889906773, "compression_ratio": 1.2432432432432432, "no_speech_prob": 9.487620758474868e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 117720, "start": 1177.2, "end": 1178.52, "text": " S\u00ed, m\u00e1s es mejor.", "tokens": [50365, 12375, 11, 3573, 785, 11479, 13, 50431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13218180338541666, "compression_ratio": 1.316546762589928, "no_speech_prob": 1.1136032200542711e-11}, {"id": 222, "seek": 117720, "start": 1178.52, "end": 1183.82, "text": " Pero si esas restricciones no son verdaderamente independientes entre s\u00ed,", "tokens": [50431, 9377, 1511, 23388, 1472, 1341, 23469, 572, 1872, 6387, 8312, 3439, 4819, 20135, 3962, 8600, 11, 50696], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13218180338541666, "compression_ratio": 1.316546762589928, "no_speech_prob": 1.1136032200542711e-11}, {"id": 223, "seek": 117720, "start": 1184.3600000000001, "end": 1189.98, "text": " terminas creando lo que el an\u00e1lisis de FlyAction llama un monocultivo de restricciones.", "tokens": [50723, 10761, 296, 1197, 1806, 450, 631, 806, 44113, 28436, 368, 25294, 32, 882, 23272, 517, 1108, 905, 723, 6340, 368, 1472, 1341, 23469, 13, 51004], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13218180338541666, "compression_ratio": 1.316546762589928, "no_speech_prob": 1.1136032200542711e-11}, {"id": 224, "seek": 118998, "start": 1189.98, "end": 1195.38, "text": " Para aterrizarlo algo cotidiano, si sigo este instinto humano de que m\u00e1s es mejor,", "tokens": [50365, 11107, 257, 391, 24959, 19457, 8655, 26529, 327, 6254, 11, 1511, 4556, 78, 4065, 1058, 17246, 30985, 368, 631, 3573, 785, 11479, 11, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10966510550920354, "compression_ratio": 1.378238341968912, "no_speech_prob": 1.1177489489533343e-11}, {"id": 225, "seek": 118998, "start": 1195.88, "end": 1201.42, "text": " podr\u00eda, no s\u00e9, instalar cuatro candados masivos y relucientes en la puerta principal de mi casa.", "tokens": [50660, 27246, 11, 572, 7910, 11, 1058, 12031, 28795, 3955, 4181, 2300, 16501, 288, 1039, 84, 5412, 279, 465, 635, 48597, 9716, 368, 2752, 9022, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10966510550920354, "compression_ratio": 1.378238341968912, "no_speech_prob": 1.1177489489533343e-11}, {"id": 226, "seek": 118998, "start": 1201.92, "end": 1206.1, "text": " Y cualquiera que los vea pensar\u00e1, wow, esto es una fortaleza impenetrable.", "tokens": [50962, 398, 10911, 35134, 631, 1750, 1241, 64, 18321, 842, 11, 6076, 11, 7433, 785, 2002, 5009, 1220, 2394, 704, 268, 302, 424, 638, 13, 51171], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10966510550920354, "compression_ratio": 1.378238341968912, "no_speech_prob": 1.1177489489533343e-11}, {"id": 227, "seek": 118998, "start": 1206.38, "end": 1206.78, "text": " Seguro.", "tokens": [51185, 1100, 2794, 340, 13, 51205], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10966510550920354, "compression_ratio": 1.378238341968912, "no_speech_prob": 1.1177489489533343e-11}, {"id": 228, "seek": 120678, "start": 1206.78, "end": 1212.8, "text": " Pero si resulta que los cuatro candados, los compr\u00e9 juntos, son exactamente del mismo fabricante,", "tokens": [50365, 9377, 1511, 1874, 64, 631, 1750, 28795, 3955, 4181, 11, 1750, 715, 10521, 33868, 11, 1872, 48686, 1103, 12461, 7253, 2879, 11, 50666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 229, "seek": 120678, "start": 1213.08, "end": 1218.3799999999999, "text": " del mismo lote de f\u00e1brica y tienen el mismo cilindro interno que resulta que puede abrirse", "tokens": [50680, 1103, 12461, 688, 68, 368, 15299, 65, 15192, 288, 12536, 806, 12461, 269, 388, 471, 340, 728, 1771, 631, 1874, 64, 631, 8919, 27446, 405, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 230, "seek": 120678, "start": 1218.3799999999999, "end": 1220.78, "text": " con la misma llave maestra que circula por ah\u00ed.", "tokens": [50945, 416, 635, 24946, 4849, 946, 463, 32036, 631, 12515, 64, 1515, 12571, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 231, "seek": 120678, "start": 1221.5, "end": 1224.12, "text": " Pues en realidad no tengo cuatro candados de seguridad.", "tokens": [51101, 22386, 465, 25635, 572, 13989, 28795, 3955, 4181, 368, 35415, 13, 51232], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 232, "seek": 120678, "start": 1224.8, "end": 1230.1399999999999, "text": " Tengo la ilusi\u00f3n est\u00e9tica de cuatro candados, pero la viabilidad matem\u00e1tica de uno solo.", "tokens": [51266, 314, 30362, 635, 1930, 301, 2560, 871, 37272, 368, 28795, 3955, 4181, 11, 4768, 635, 1932, 5177, 4580, 3803, 443, 23432, 368, 8526, 6944, 13, 51533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 233, "seek": 120678, "start": 1230.34, "end": 1230.8999999999999, "text": " Totalmente.", "tokens": [51543, 23170, 4082, 13, 51571], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 234, "seek": 120678, "start": 1231.3799999999999, "end": 1236.34, "text": " Si un ladr\u00f3n descubre c\u00f3mo vulnerar la cerradura de uno, los cuatro caen simult\u00e1neamente.", "tokens": [51595, 4909, 517, 6632, 81, 1801, 32592, 265, 12826, 8184, 289, 635, 10146, 6206, 2991, 368, 8526, 11, 1750, 28795, 1335, 268, 13899, 842, 716, 3439, 13, 51843], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08870496141149643, "compression_ratio": 1.7761732851985559, "no_speech_prob": 1.1267981339657673e-11}, {"id": 235, "seek": 123634, "start": 1237.1, "end": 1238.12, "text": " Exactamente eso.", "tokens": [50403, 7199, 3439, 7287, 13, 50454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 236, "seek": 123634, "start": 1238.72, "end": 1240.3, "text": " Es un monocultivo de seguridad.", "tokens": [50484, 2313, 517, 1108, 905, 723, 6340, 368, 35415, 13, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 237, "seek": 123634, "start": 1240.98, "end": 1245.56, "text": " Y biol\u00f3gicamente, los monocultivos agr\u00edcolas son arrasados por una sola plaga.", "tokens": [50597, 398, 3228, 401, 812, 11577, 3439, 11, 1750, 1108, 905, 723, 16501, 623, 40577, 8768, 296, 1872, 594, 3906, 4181, 1515, 2002, 34162, 499, 9286, 13, 50826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 238, "seek": 123634, "start": 1246.22, "end": 1251.22, "text": " En el mundo de la ingenier\u00eda de software o la burocracia humana, ocurre exactamente lo mismo.", "tokens": [50859, 2193, 806, 7968, 368, 635, 21600, 811, 2686, 368, 4722, 277, 635, 758, 340, 10757, 28000, 1952, 64, 11, 26430, 265, 48686, 450, 12461, 13, 51109], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 239, "seek": 123634, "start": 1251.9399999999998, "end": 1255.6399999999999, "text": " El texto presenta un ejemplo fenomenal con inspectores de construcci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51145, 2699, 35503, 1974, 64, 517, 13358, 26830, 4726, 304, 416, 15018, 2706, 368, 12946, 14735, 13, 51330], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 240, "seek": 123634, "start": 1255.86, "end": 1256.1599999999999, "text": " A ver.", "tokens": [51341, 316, 1306, 13, 51356], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 241, "seek": 123634, "start": 1256.56, "end": 1261.8999999999999, "text": " Imaginemos que env\u00edas a cinco inspectores diferentes a evaluar la integridad estructural de un puente nuevo.", "tokens": [51376, 34223, 259, 4485, 631, 2267, 10025, 257, 21350, 15018, 2706, 17686, 257, 6133, 289, 635, 3572, 4580, 43935, 1807, 368, 517, 2362, 1576, 18591, 13, 51643], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11270896850093719, "compression_ratio": 1.6108949416342413, "no_speech_prob": 9.598000345889535e-12}, {"id": 242, "seek": 126190, "start": 1261.9, "end": 1268.2, "text": " A nivel de estado superficial, podr\u00edas decir que tienes cinco niveles de redundencia, cinco pares de ojos.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 24423, 368, 18372, 34622, 11, 15305, 10025, 10235, 631, 20716, 21350, 11461, 904, 368, 27830, 10974, 11, 21350, 2502, 495, 368, 39519, 13, 50680], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 243, "seek": 126190, "start": 1268.4, "end": 1269.16, "text": " Suena muy seguro.", "tokens": [50690, 2746, 4118, 5323, 31424, 13, 50728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 244, "seek": 126190, "start": 1269.46, "end": 1273.8400000000001, "text": " Pero si al investigar descubres que los cinco inspectores estudiaron en la misma universidad,", "tokens": [50743, 9377, 1511, 419, 4557, 289, 32592, 495, 631, 1750, 21350, 15018, 2706, 13542, 72, 6372, 465, 635, 24946, 5950, 4580, 11, 50962], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 245, "seek": 126190, "start": 1274.42, "end": 1281.3200000000002, "text": " tomaron el mismo curso con el mismo profesor y usan exactamente la misma lista de verificaci\u00f3n estandarizada,", "tokens": [50991, 2916, 6372, 806, 12461, 31085, 416, 806, 12461, 22912, 284, 288, 505, 282, 48686, 635, 24946, 27764, 368, 1306, 40802, 871, 474, 289, 39600, 11, 51336], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 246, "seek": 126190, "start": 1281.76, "end": 1283.7, "text": " tu diversidad real es cero.", "tokens": [51358, 2604, 6111, 4580, 957, 785, 269, 2032, 13, 51455], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 247, "seek": 126190, "start": 1284.0, "end": 1284.46, "text": " \u00a1Guau!", "tokens": [51470, 6514, 25627, 1459, 0, 51493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1038366449941503, "compression_ratio": 1.5775862068965518, "no_speech_prob": 9.378066899434767e-12}, {"id": 248, "seek": 128446, "start": 1284.46, "end": 1293.52, "text": " Si hay un punto ciego en ese plan de estudios universitario, los cinco inspectores, de manera totalmente independiente y sin ponerse de acuerdo,", "tokens": [50365, 4909, 4842, 517, 14326, 269, 12200, 465, 10167, 1393, 368, 13542, 2717, 5950, 3981, 1004, 11, 1750, 21350, 15018, 2706, 11, 368, 13913, 30865, 4819, 8413, 288, 3343, 19149, 405, 368, 28113, 11, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06592869332858495, "compression_ratio": 1.6111111111111112, "no_speech_prob": 8.020935478303404e-12}, {"id": 249, "seek": 128446, "start": 1294.04, "end": 1297.02, "text": " pasar\u00e1n por alto la misma grieta letal en el puente.", "tokens": [50844, 25344, 7200, 1515, 21275, 635, 24946, 17865, 7664, 718, 304, 465, 806, 2362, 1576, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06592869332858495, "compression_ratio": 1.6111111111111112, "no_speech_prob": 8.020935478303404e-12}, {"id": 250, "seek": 128446, "start": 1297.38, "end": 1305.08, "text": " Pero a nivel de la burocracia corporativa, t\u00fa mandas el reporte diciendo que tienes un sistema robusto avalado por cinco personas.", "tokens": [51011, 9377, 257, 24423, 368, 635, 758, 340, 10757, 28000, 6804, 18740, 11, 15056, 7411, 296, 806, 2275, 68, 42797, 631, 20716, 517, 13245, 13956, 78, 1305, 304, 1573, 1515, 21350, 12019, 13, 51396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06592869332858495, "compression_ratio": 1.6111111111111112, "no_speech_prob": 8.020935478303404e-12}, {"id": 251, "seek": 128446, "start": 1305.7, "end": 1310.48, "text": " Solemos pensar que estamos a\u00f1adiendo seguridad cuando en realidad solo estamos agregando ruido y gasto.", "tokens": [51427, 48073, 3415, 18321, 631, 10382, 44980, 7304, 35415, 7767, 465, 25635, 6944, 10382, 623, 3375, 1806, 5420, 2925, 288, 17898, 78, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06592869332858495, "compression_ratio": 1.6111111111111112, "no_speech_prob": 8.020935478303404e-12}, {"id": 252, "seek": 131048, "start": 1310.48, "end": 1316.44, "text": " De hecho, el autor entra en la matem\u00e1tica pura con ecuaciones para demostrar que si dentro de un sistema gigante", "tokens": [50365, 1346, 13064, 11, 806, 19510, 22284, 465, 635, 3803, 443, 23432, 1864, 64, 416, 11437, 84, 9188, 1690, 41556, 5352, 631, 1511, 10856, 368, 517, 13245, 8741, 2879, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07343633713260773, "compression_ratio": 1.5625, "no_speech_prob": 9.943965789682707e-12}, {"id": 253, "seek": 131048, "start": 1316.44, "end": 1323.52, "text": " tienes un par de reglas que secretamente entran en conflicto, o sea, reglas que tiran en direcciones opuestas para resolver el mismo problema,", "tokens": [50663, 20716, 517, 971, 368, 1121, 7743, 631, 4054, 3439, 948, 4257, 465, 6596, 78, 11, 277, 4158, 11, 1121, 7743, 631, 13807, 282, 465, 1264, 35560, 999, 47794, 1690, 34480, 806, 12461, 12395, 11, 51017], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07343633713260773, "compression_ratio": 1.5625, "no_speech_prob": 9.943965789682707e-12}, {"id": 254, "seek": 131048, "start": 1324.08, "end": 1326.26, "text": " esas fuerzas se cancelan mutuamente en la ecuaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51045, 23388, 17669, 24561, 369, 10373, 282, 5839, 84, 3439, 465, 635, 11437, 84, 3482, 13, 51154], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07343633713260773, "compression_ratio": 1.5625, "no_speech_prob": 9.943965789682707e-12}, {"id": 255, "seek": 131048, "start": 1326.96, "end": 1327.92, "text": " S\u00ed, se anulan.", "tokens": [51189, 12375, 11, 369, 364, 40701, 13, 51237], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07343633713260773, "compression_ratio": 1.5625, "no_speech_prob": 9.943965789682707e-12}, {"id": 256, "seek": 132792, "start": 1327.92, "end": 1338.18, "text": " Y debido a esa cancelaci\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica, t\u00fa puedes mirar la arquitectura de tu empresa y ver una diversidad enorme de protocolos y manuales,", "tokens": [50365, 398, 50003, 257, 11342, 10373, 3482, 3803, 443, 23432, 11, 15056, 19010, 3149, 289, 635, 40258, 5739, 2991, 368, 2604, 22682, 288, 1306, 2002, 6111, 4580, 33648, 368, 10336, 329, 288, 9688, 279, 11, 50878], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07288229624430338, "compression_ratio": 1.407216494845361, "no_speech_prob": 9.488646847410909e-12}, {"id": 257, "seek": 132792, "start": 1338.44, "end": 1348.9, "text": " cuando en la pr\u00e1ctica real, el 75% de tu sistema gigantesco podr\u00eda reducirse a una sola regla repetida con cientos de sin\u00f3nimos.", "tokens": [50891, 7767, 465, 635, 27300, 29041, 957, 11, 806, 9562, 4, 368, 2604, 13245, 8741, 9327, 1291, 27246, 2783, 23568, 405, 257, 2002, 34162, 1121, 875, 13645, 2887, 416, 269, 20370, 368, 3343, 1801, 8372, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07288229624430338, "compression_ratio": 1.407216494845361, "no_speech_prob": 9.488646847410909e-12}, {"id": 258, "seek": 134890, "start": 1348.9, "end": 1357.3400000000001, "text": " Y por eso este texto nos exige dejar de evaluar la robustez de nuestros sistemas por el peso f\u00edsico de sus manuales o las l\u00edneas de c\u00f3digo", "tokens": [50365, 398, 1515, 7287, 4065, 35503, 3269, 454, 3969, 24391, 368, 6133, 289, 635, 13956, 4371, 368, 24099, 48720, 1515, 806, 28149, 27538, 2789, 368, 3291, 9688, 279, 277, 2439, 16118, 716, 296, 368, 44195, 50787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050240597634945275, "compression_ratio": 1.59375, "no_speech_prob": 8.082494742933655e-12}, {"id": 259, "seek": 134890, "start": 1357.3400000000001, "end": 1361.0600000000002, "text": " y empezar a evaluarlos por su ortogonalidad matem\u00e1tica.", "tokens": [50787, 288, 31168, 257, 6133, 39734, 1515, 459, 23564, 664, 21523, 4580, 3803, 443, 23432, 13, 50973], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050240597634945275, "compression_ratio": 1.59375, "no_speech_prob": 8.082494742933655e-12}, {"id": 260, "seek": 134890, "start": 1361.6000000000001, "end": 1368.8600000000001, "text": " Las reglas verdaderamente \u00fatiles, las que salvan el sistema, son aquellas que fallan bajo condiciones radicalmente diferentes,", "tokens": [51000, 10663, 1121, 7743, 6387, 8312, 3439, 6991, 83, 4680, 11, 2439, 631, 1845, 9768, 806, 13245, 11, 1872, 33635, 296, 631, 2100, 282, 30139, 45960, 12001, 4082, 17686, 11, 51363], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050240597634945275, "compression_ratio": 1.59375, "no_speech_prob": 8.082494742933655e-12}, {"id": 261, "seek": 134890, "start": 1369.3600000000001, "end": 1373.72, "text": " cubriendo los puntos ciegos de las dem\u00e1s y protegiendo continuaciones distintas.", "tokens": [51388, 10057, 470, 3999, 1750, 34375, 30596, 18674, 368, 2439, 34682, 288, 49157, 7304, 2993, 9188, 31489, 296, 13, 51606], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050240597634945275, "compression_ratio": 1.59375, "no_speech_prob": 8.082494742933655e-12}, {"id": 262, "seek": 137372, "start": 1373.72, "end": 1379.52, "text": " Y justo cuando la cabeza te da vueltas pensando en inspectores, c\u00f3digos y candados,", "tokens": [50365, 398, 40534, 7767, 635, 34615, 535, 1120, 9732, 2018, 296, 34525, 465, 15018, 2706, 11, 40210, 13348, 288, 3955, 4181, 11, 50655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06686244055489514, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 9.941858100659395e-12}, {"id": 263, "seek": 137372, "start": 1380.0, "end": 1386.3600000000001, "text": " el autor hace un giro de tim\u00f3n espectacular, toma toda esta teor\u00eda abstracta de la historia continua,", "tokens": [50679, 806, 19510, 10032, 517, 1735, 340, 368, 524, 1801, 38244, 14700, 11, 39728, 11687, 5283, 40238, 2686, 12649, 64, 368, 635, 18385, 40861, 11, 50997], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06686244055489514, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 9.941858100659395e-12}, {"id": 264, "seek": 137372, "start": 1386.8600000000001, "end": 1394.34, "text": " la compresi\u00f3n y las continuaciones futuras, y la saca del papel para arrojarla de golpe a la f\u00edsica del mundo real,", "tokens": [51022, 635, 715, 495, 2560, 288, 2439, 2993, 9188, 1877, 12907, 11, 288, 635, 4899, 64, 1103, 24710, 1690, 594, 340, 10150, 875, 368, 42032, 257, 635, 46436, 1103, 7968, 957, 11, 51396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06686244055489514, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 9.941858100659395e-12}, {"id": 265, "seek": 137372, "start": 1394.9, "end": 1398.64, "text": " a la biomec\u00e1mica de la locomoci\u00f3n, el simple acto de caminar.", "tokens": [51424, 257, 635, 3228, 423, 66, 19524, 2262, 368, 635, 36369, 78, 5687, 11, 806, 2199, 605, 78, 368, 1945, 6470, 13, 51611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06686244055489514, "compression_ratio": 1.5677966101694916, "no_speech_prob": 9.941858100659395e-12}, {"id": 266, "seek": 139864, "start": 1398.64, "end": 1405.5600000000002, "text": " Es un cierre maestro para los documentos, porque, en \u00faltima instancia, caminar de forma b\u00edpeda sobre dos piernas", "tokens": [50365, 2313, 517, 39769, 265, 463, 32389, 1690, 1750, 4166, 329, 11, 4021, 11, 465, 28118, 1058, 22862, 11, 1945, 6470, 368, 8366, 272, 870, 3452, 64, 5473, 4491, 9766, 18979, 50711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 267, "seek": 139864, "start": 1405.5600000000002, "end": 1408.48, "text": " es el desaf\u00edo supremo de proteger un futuro posible.", "tokens": [50711, 785, 806, 34587, 20492, 23710, 78, 368, 1742, 30744, 517, 23953, 26644, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 268, "seek": 139864, "start": 1408.76, "end": 1409.38, "text": " \u00bfQu\u00e9 futuro?", "tokens": [50871, 3841, 15137, 23953, 30, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 269, "seek": 139864, "start": 1409.68, "end": 1413.0200000000002, "text": " El futuro espec\u00edfico en el que no te estrellas la cara contra el suelo.", "tokens": [50917, 2699, 23953, 32741, 78, 465, 806, 631, 572, 535, 871, 19771, 296, 635, 10962, 10742, 806, 459, 10590, 13, 51084], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 270, "seek": 139864, "start": 1413.6200000000001, "end": 1416.42, "text": " Mantener el balance es gestionar futuros constantemente.", "tokens": [51114, 32829, 7971, 806, 4772, 785, 7219, 33639, 1877, 8977, 5754, 16288, 13, 51254], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 271, "seek": 139864, "start": 1416.88, "end": 1423.66, "text": " Y la forma en que los robots tradicionales intentan caminar es la perfecta ilustraci\u00f3n de la trampa del Estado que venimos criticando.", "tokens": [51277, 398, 635, 8366, 465, 631, 1750, 14733, 47956, 279, 8446, 282, 1945, 6470, 785, 635, 2176, 64, 1930, 381, 46205, 368, 635, 504, 26625, 1103, 29740, 631, 6138, 8372, 7850, 1806, 13, 51616], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07499104930508521, "compression_ratio": 1.56993006993007, "no_speech_prob": 1.0061312026576896e-11}, {"id": 272, "seek": 142366, "start": 1423.66, "end": 1431.14, "text": " Claro. El paradigma cl\u00e1sico de un robot caminante, los de hace unos a\u00f1os, es puro c\u00e1lculo fotogr\u00e1fico.", "tokens": [50365, 33380, 13, 2699, 13480, 16150, 47434, 2789, 368, 517, 7881, 1945, 259, 2879, 11, 1750, 368, 10032, 17780, 11424, 11, 785, 2362, 340, 6476, 75, 25436, 15418, 47810, 23858, 78, 13, 50739], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10095949008547027, "compression_ratio": 1.516, "no_speech_prob": 1.1180192188708915e-11}, {"id": 273, "seek": 142366, "start": 1431.64, "end": 1437.24, "text": " El cerebro de la m\u00e1quina escanea el terreno, calcula los \u00e1ngulos trigonom\u00e9tricos necesarios,", "tokens": [50764, 2699, 11643, 9120, 368, 635, 49360, 4721, 1929, 64, 806, 1796, 48207, 11, 4322, 64, 1750, 7352, 872, 28348, 35386, 12481, 4051, 1341, 329, 11909, 9720, 11, 51044], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10095949008547027, "compression_ratio": 1.516, "no_speech_prob": 1.1180192188708915e-11}, {"id": 274, "seek": 142366, "start": 1437.8600000000001, "end": 1444.5600000000002, "text": " dice, necesito que la rodilla derecha est\u00e9 exactamente a 43 grados y el tobillo a 12,", "tokens": [51075, 10313, 11, 11909, 3528, 631, 635, 8685, 5291, 15969, 4413, 34584, 48686, 257, 17914, 2771, 329, 288, 806, 20676, 15831, 257, 2272, 11, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10095949008547027, "compression_ratio": 1.516, "no_speech_prob": 1.1180192188708915e-11}, {"id": 275, "seek": 142366, "start": 1444.94, "end": 1449.92, "text": " y luego usa motores potentes para forzar la pierna hasta esa posici\u00f3n est\u00e1tica.", "tokens": [51429, 288, 17222, 29909, 2184, 2706, 1847, 9240, 1690, 337, 26236, 635, 9766, 629, 10764, 11342, 46595, 3192, 83, 2262, 13, 51678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10095949008547027, "compression_ratio": 1.516, "no_speech_prob": 1.1180192188708915e-11}, {"id": 276, "seek": 142366, "start": 1450.28, "end": 1450.92, "text": " Exacto.", "tokens": [51696, 7199, 78, 13, 51728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10095949008547027, "compression_ratio": 1.516, "no_speech_prob": 1.1180192188708915e-11}, {"id": 277, "seek": 145092, "start": 1450.92, "end": 1458.5600000000002, "text": " Llega all\u00ed, se equilibra temblando un poco, toma otra fotograf\u00eda del mundo y vuelve a calcular el siguiente estado,", "tokens": [50365, 441, 306, 3680, 34294, 11, 369, 14204, 424, 1383, 65, 16201, 517, 10639, 11, 39728, 13623, 34341, 2686, 1103, 7968, 288, 20126, 303, 257, 2104, 17792, 806, 25666, 18372, 11, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 145092, "start": 1459.04, "end": 1460.3000000000002, "text": " postura tras postura.", "tokens": [50771, 2183, 2991, 22507, 2183, 2991, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 145092, "start": 1460.74, "end": 1463.4, "text": " Es inmensamente ineficiente y torpe.", "tokens": [50856, 2313, 41052, 694, 3439, 7167, 26863, 288, 3930, 494, 13, 50989], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 145092, "start": 1464.04, "end": 1466.26, "text": " Pero los organismos biol\u00f3gicos no hacen eso.", "tokens": [51021, 9377, 1750, 24128, 329, 3228, 27629, 9940, 572, 27434, 7287, 13, 51132], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 145092, "start": 1466.68, "end": 1470.1000000000001, "text": " Los animales operan bajo un paradigma centrado en la trayectoria,", "tokens": [51153, 7632, 45102, 2208, 282, 30139, 517, 13480, 16150, 1489, 14974, 465, 635, 16027, 557, 8172, 11, 51324], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 282, "seek": 145092, "start": 1470.5600000000002, "end": 1472.94, "text": " gobernado por redes neuronales especializadas,", "tokens": [51347, 352, 26848, 1573, 1515, 16762, 34090, 4229, 15342, 590, 6872, 11, 51466], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 283, "seek": 145092, "start": 1473.3600000000001, "end": 1476.02, "text": " conocidas como generadores de patrones centrales.", "tokens": [51487, 15871, 11382, 2617, 1337, 11856, 368, 21843, 279, 5777, 279, 13, 51620], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09212112426757812, "compression_ratio": 1.5524193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 9.560680372389108e-12}, {"id": 284, "seek": 147602, "start": 1476.02, "end": 1481.76, "text": " Y aqu\u00ed es donde la geometr\u00eda matem\u00e1tica se cruza de manera brillante con la biolog\u00eda en la investigaci\u00f3n de Flaxion.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 6661, 785, 10488, 635, 12956, 37183, 3803, 443, 23432, 369, 5140, 2394, 368, 13913, 8695, 2879, 416, 635, 3228, 29987, 465, 635, 48919, 368, 479, 25923, 313, 13, 50652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14427123879486659, "compression_ratio": 1.2885906040268456, "no_speech_prob": 8.91427036353587e-12}, {"id": 285, "seek": 147602, "start": 1482.3, "end": 1486.4, "text": " Introduce una transformaci\u00f3n geom\u00e9trica te\u00f3rica llamada amplituist.", "tokens": [50679, 27193, 384, 2002, 4088, 3482, 1519, 298, 4051, 15192, 535, 812, 15192, 16848, 1538, 9731, 6380, 468, 13, 50884], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14427123879486659, "compression_ratio": 1.2885906040268456, "no_speech_prob": 8.91427036353587e-12}, {"id": 286, "seek": 148640, "start": 1486.4, "end": 1491.5800000000002, "text": " Hey, esta parte es densa, as\u00ed que requiere que vayamos un poco m\u00e1s despacio.", "tokens": [50365, 1911, 11, 5283, 6975, 785, 274, 23364, 11, 8582, 631, 1724, 14412, 631, 371, 320, 2151, 517, 10639, 3573, 4887, 24571, 13, 50624], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09750656697941923, "compression_ratio": 1.4484536082474226, "no_speech_prob": 1.092142955932962e-11}, {"id": 287, "seek": 148640, "start": 1492.22, "end": 1498.44, "text": " El amplituist, seg\u00fan entiendo, es una operaci\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica que combina dos cosas muy simples.", "tokens": [50656, 2699, 9731, 6380, 468, 11, 36570, 948, 7304, 11, 785, 2002, 2208, 3482, 3803, 443, 23432, 631, 2512, 1426, 4491, 12218, 5323, 21730, 13, 50967], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09750656697941923, "compression_ratio": 1.4484536082474226, "no_speech_prob": 1.092142955932962e-11}, {"id": 288, "seek": 148640, "start": 1499.02, "end": 1503.94, "text": " Por un lado, una escala o amplitud, que dice qu\u00e9 tanto se estira algo,", "tokens": [50996, 5269, 517, 11631, 11, 2002, 4721, 5159, 277, 9731, 21875, 11, 631, 10313, 8057, 10331, 369, 871, 4271, 8655, 11, 51242], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09750656697941923, "compression_ratio": 1.4484536082474226, "no_speech_prob": 1.092142955932962e-11}, {"id": 289, "seek": 148640, "start": 1504.3400000000001, "end": 1506.8400000000001, "text": " y por otro, una rotaci\u00f3n o giro.", "tokens": [51262, 288, 1515, 11921, 11, 2002, 4297, 3482, 277, 1735, 340, 13, 51387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09750656697941923, "compression_ratio": 1.4484536082474226, "no_speech_prob": 1.092142955932962e-11}, {"id": 290, "seek": 150684, "start": 1506.84, "end": 1514.6999999999998, "text": " \u00bfC\u00f3mo es que algo tan abstracto de una pizarra matem\u00e1tica se traduce en mi pierna dando un paso real en la calle?", "tokens": [50365, 3841, 28342, 785, 631, 8655, 7603, 12649, 78, 368, 2002, 280, 9736, 424, 3803, 443, 23432, 369, 2479, 4176, 465, 2752, 9766, 629, 29854, 517, 29212, 957, 465, 635, 45092, 30, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 291, "seek": 150684, "start": 1514.9599999999998, "end": 1518.4399999999998, "text": " Pues piensa en el movimiento fluido de una extremidad biol\u00f3gica.", "tokens": [50771, 22386, 3895, 23364, 465, 806, 43180, 5029, 2925, 368, 2002, 4040, 4580, 3228, 27629, 2262, 13, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 292, "seek": 150684, "start": 1518.76, "end": 1521.32, "text": " No se trata de lograr \u00e1ngulos est\u00e1ticos aislados.", "tokens": [50961, 883, 369, 31920, 368, 31013, 289, 7352, 872, 28348, 3192, 83, 9940, 257, 5788, 4181, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 293, "seek": 150684, "start": 1521.8, "end": 1523.6599999999999, "text": " La combinaci\u00f3n continua de escala,", "tokens": [51113, 2369, 38514, 3482, 40861, 368, 4721, 5159, 11, 51206], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 294, "seek": 150684, "start": 1523.9599999999998, "end": 1529.74, "text": " que en la anatom\u00eda de la pierna ser\u00eda la extensi\u00f3n y contracci\u00f3n de los m\u00fasculos para absorber el peso o empujar el suelo,", "tokens": [51221, 631, 465, 635, 21618, 298, 2686, 368, 635, 9766, 629, 23679, 635, 1279, 694, 2560, 288, 48118, 5687, 368, 1750, 38886, 32397, 1690, 7672, 607, 806, 28149, 277, 4012, 4579, 289, 806, 459, 10590, 11, 51510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 295, "seek": 150684, "start": 1530.22, "end": 1534.04, "text": " y la rotaci\u00f3n, que es el giro f\u00edsico de la cadera o la rodilla avanzando,", "tokens": [51534, 288, 635, 4297, 3482, 11, 631, 785, 806, 1735, 340, 27538, 2789, 368, 635, 12209, 1663, 277, 635, 8685, 5291, 42444, 1806, 11, 51725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08065244367906263, "compression_ratio": 1.6177474402730376, "no_speech_prob": 8.640209207821936e-12}, {"id": 296, "seek": 153404, "start": 1534.04, "end": 1537.1, "text": " encapsula la naturaleza exacta de dar un paso.", "tokens": [50365, 38745, 3780, 635, 40877, 2394, 1900, 64, 368, 4072, 517, 29212, 13, 50518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 297, "seek": 153404, "start": 1537.42, "end": 1537.6399999999999, "text": " Ok.", "tokens": [50534, 3477, 13, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 298, "seek": 153404, "start": 1538.2, "end": 1543.12, "text": " Y en lugar de tener una computadora central en el cerebro calculando cada posici\u00f3n como el robot,", "tokens": [50573, 398, 465, 11467, 368, 11640, 2002, 2807, 23020, 5777, 465, 806, 11643, 9120, 4322, 1806, 8411, 46595, 2617, 806, 7881, 11, 50819], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 299, "seek": 153404, "start": 1543.52, "end": 1546.8999999999999, "text": " el cuerpo usa algo llamado el modelo de osciladores de Kuramoto.", "tokens": [50839, 806, 20264, 29909, 8655, 47055, 806, 27825, 368, 3003, 3208, 11856, 368, 16481, 35858, 13, 51008], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 300, "seek": 153404, "start": 1547.18, "end": 1549.34, "text": " Espera, me atasco un poco aqu\u00ed.", "tokens": [51022, 24142, 64, 11, 385, 412, 296, 1291, 517, 10639, 6661, 13, 51130], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 301, "seek": 153404, "start": 1549.92, "end": 1552.04, "text": " Si tengo todos estos osciladores biol\u00f3gicos,", "tokens": [51159, 4909, 13989, 6321, 12585, 3003, 3208, 11856, 3228, 27629, 9940, 11, 51265], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 302, "seek": 153404, "start": 1552.96, "end": 1558.8, "text": " que seg\u00fan le\u00ed son b\u00e1sicamente grupos de nervios en mis caderas, mis rodillas y tobillos,", "tokens": [51311, 631, 36570, 476, 870, 1872, 48282, 33758, 368, 5724, 2717, 465, 3346, 12209, 6985, 11, 3346, 8685, 20243, 288, 20676, 47476, 11, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 303, "seek": 153404, "start": 1559.36, "end": 1563.1399999999999, "text": " latiendo a su propio ritmo como metr\u00f3nomos independientes,", "tokens": [51631, 4465, 7304, 257, 459, 40098, 11289, 3280, 2617, 1131, 81, 1801, 40934, 4819, 20135, 11, 51820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11828217543954925, "compression_ratio": 1.5724381625441697, "no_speech_prob": 8.807840741476003e-12}, {"id": 304, "seek": 156314, "start": 1563.14, "end": 1568.66, "text": " \u00bfc\u00f3mo es que no me convierto en un mont\u00f3n de m\u00fasculos temblando en el suelo sin control?", "tokens": [50365, 3841, 46614, 785, 631, 572, 385, 3754, 20747, 465, 517, 45259, 368, 38886, 32397, 1383, 65, 16201, 465, 806, 459, 10590, 3343, 1969, 30, 50641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0892076029360873, "compression_ratio": 1.5330396475770924, "no_speech_prob": 9.414932375384488e-12}, {"id": 305, "seek": 156314, "start": 1569.3200000000002, "end": 1573.5800000000002, "text": " \u00bfQu\u00e9 o qui\u00e9n orquesta todo ese caos si no hay un c\u00e1lculo central?", "tokens": [50674, 3841, 15137, 277, 35327, 420, 358, 7841, 5149, 10167, 1335, 329, 1511, 572, 4842, 517, 6476, 75, 25436, 5777, 30, 50887], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0892076029360873, "compression_ratio": 1.5330396475770924, "no_speech_prob": 9.414932375384488e-12}, {"id": 306, "seek": 156314, "start": 1574.22, "end": 1576.2, "text": " Esa es la genialidad de la evoluci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [50919, 2313, 64, 785, 635, 48228, 4580, 368, 635, 7117, 30813, 13, 51018], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0892076029360873, "compression_ratio": 1.5330396475770924, "no_speech_prob": 9.414932375384488e-12}, {"id": 307, "seek": 156314, "start": 1576.9, "end": 1579.98, "text": " No hay un director de orquesta central calculando la pose final.", "tokens": [51053, 883, 4842, 517, 5391, 368, 420, 358, 7841, 5777, 4322, 1806, 635, 10774, 2572, 13, 51207], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0892076029360873, "compression_ratio": 1.5330396475770924, "no_speech_prob": 9.414932375384488e-12}, {"id": 308, "seek": 156314, "start": 1580.64, "end": 1584.46, "text": " La orquestaci\u00f3n ocurre de forma distribuida por acoplamiento local y coherencia.", "tokens": [51240, 2369, 420, 20343, 3482, 26430, 265, 368, 8366, 4400, 84, 2887, 1515, 696, 404, 4326, 7814, 2654, 288, 26528, 10974, 13, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0892076029360873, "compression_ratio": 1.5330396475770924, "no_speech_prob": 9.414932375384488e-12}, {"id": 309, "seek": 158446, "start": 1584.46, "end": 1586.42, "text": " Pensemos en esos metr\u00f3nomos.", "tokens": [50365, 430, 1288, 3415, 465, 22411, 1131, 81, 1801, 40934, 13, 50463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 310, "seek": 158446, "start": 1586.96, "end": 1588.44, "text": " Si los pones sobre una tabla m\u00f3vil,", "tokens": [50490, 4909, 1750, 280, 2213, 5473, 2002, 4421, 875, 32515, 20202, 11, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 311, "seek": 158446, "start": 1588.6000000000001, "end": 1591.64, "text": " tarde o temprano la peque\u00f1a vibraci\u00f3n que comparten a trav\u00e9s de la madera", "tokens": [50572, 27367, 277, 1383, 1424, 3730, 635, 47177, 11599, 3482, 631, 715, 11719, 257, 24463, 368, 635, 5244, 1663, 50724], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 312, "seek": 158446, "start": 1591.64, "end": 1593.66, "text": " los obliga f\u00edsicamente a sincronizarse,", "tokens": [50724, 1750, 9270, 64, 27538, 23653, 257, 3343, 66, 2044, 9736, 405, 11, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 313, "seek": 158446, "start": 1594.06, "end": 1595.72, "text": " a encontrar una coherencia compartida.", "tokens": [50845, 257, 17525, 2002, 26528, 10974, 18113, 2887, 13, 50928], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 314, "seek": 158446, "start": 1596.08, "end": 1598.46, "text": " Ah, la sincronizaci\u00f3n espont\u00e1nea.", "tokens": [50946, 2438, 11, 635, 3343, 66, 2044, 27603, 7089, 896, 842, 22160, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 315, "seek": 158446, "start": 1598.74, "end": 1598.96, "text": " S\u00ed.", "tokens": [51079, 12375, 13, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 316, "seek": 158446, "start": 1599.32, "end": 1602.3, "text": " En el cuerpo humano esta coherencia ocurre de forma jer\u00e1rquica.", "tokens": [51108, 2193, 806, 20264, 30985, 5283, 26528, 10974, 26430, 265, 368, 8366, 20160, 20335, 358, 2262, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 317, "seek": 158446, "start": 1602.8600000000001, "end": 1604.9, "text": " Los osciladores de una sola articulaci\u00f3n,", "tokens": [51285, 7632, 3003, 3208, 11856, 368, 2002, 34162, 15228, 425, 3482, 11, 51387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 318, "seek": 158446, "start": 1605.48, "end": 1606.32, "text": " digamos el tobillo,", "tokens": [51416, 36430, 806, 20676, 15831, 11, 51458], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 319, "seek": 158446, "start": 1606.72, "end": 1609.38, "text": " se sincronizan primero para generar una amplitud local.", "tokens": [51478, 369, 3343, 66, 2044, 590, 282, 21289, 1690, 1337, 289, 2002, 9731, 21875, 2654, 13, 51611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13509208626217312, "compression_ratio": 1.5774647887323943, "no_speech_prob": 9.751895471699079e-12}, {"id": 320, "seek": 160938, "start": 1609.38, "end": 1614.96, "text": " Luego, esos movimientos conjuntos se sincronizan con las otras articulaciones", "tokens": [50365, 45665, 11, 22411, 2402, 34841, 20295, 2760, 329, 369, 3343, 66, 2044, 590, 282, 416, 2439, 20244, 15228, 425, 9188, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 321, "seek": 160938, "start": 1614.96, "end": 1616.1000000000001, "text": " de esa misma pierna,", "tokens": [50644, 368, 11342, 24946, 9766, 629, 11, 50701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 322, "seek": 160938, "start": 1616.5, "end": 1618.8200000000002, "text": " creando un patr\u00f3n estable para toda la extremidad.", "tokens": [50721, 1197, 1806, 517, 1947, 81, 1801, 37444, 1690, 11687, 635, 4040, 4580, 13, 50837], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 323, "seek": 160938, "start": 1619.44, "end": 1620.0400000000002, "text": " Y finalmente,", "tokens": [50868, 398, 35577, 11, 50898], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 324, "seek": 160938, "start": 1620.5200000000002, "end": 1622.7600000000002, "text": " ambas piernas se sincronizan a trav\u00e9s de la cadera", "tokens": [50922, 3913, 296, 9766, 18979, 369, 3343, 66, 2044, 590, 282, 257, 24463, 368, 635, 12209, 1663, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 325, "seek": 160938, "start": 1622.7600000000002, "end": 1625.0600000000002, "text": " para generar la marcha del cuerpo completo.", "tokens": [51034, 1690, 1337, 289, 635, 8368, 64, 1103, 20264, 40135, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 326, "seek": 160938, "start": 1625.5600000000002, "end": 1626.0800000000002, "text": " Entonces,", "tokens": [51174, 15097, 11, 51200], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 327, "seek": 160938, "start": 1626.98, "end": 1630.3600000000001, "text": " \u00bfqu\u00e9 significa todo esto a nivel filos\u00f3fico de la teor\u00eda?", "tokens": [51245, 3841, 16412, 19957, 5149, 7433, 257, 24423, 46045, 812, 1786, 78, 368, 635, 40238, 2686, 30, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 328, "seek": 160938, "start": 1631.16, "end": 1635.14, "text": " Es como el crecimiento de un helecho fractal en la naturaleza.", "tokens": [51454, 2313, 2617, 806, 31668, 14007, 368, 517, 16812, 5738, 17948, 304, 465, 635, 40877, 2394, 13, 51653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 329, "seek": 160938, "start": 1635.4, "end": 1636.1000000000001, "text": " \u00a1Qu\u00e9 buena imagen!", "tokens": [51666, 6514, 15137, 25710, 40652, 0, 51701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 330, "seek": 160938, "start": 1636.1000000000001, "end": 1639.16, "text": " Es que no hay un plano maestro en la semilla", "tokens": [51701, 2313, 631, 572, 4842, 517, 40259, 463, 32389, 465, 635, 4361, 5291, 51854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1289135726181777, "compression_ratio": 1.5574324324324325, "no_speech_prob": 7.958570434618562e-12}, {"id": 331, "seek": 163916, "start": 1639.16, "end": 1643.6000000000001, "text": " que le dicte a la planta en qu\u00e9 coordenadas tridimensionales exactas", "tokens": [50365, 631, 476, 14285, 975, 257, 635, 3709, 64, 465, 8057, 14230, 268, 6872, 504, 327, 332, 11075, 279, 1900, 296, 50587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 332, "seek": 163916, "start": 1643.6000000000001, "end": 1646.88, "text": " debe colocar la punta de cada peque\u00f1a hoja al crecer.", "tokens": [50587, 27422, 17568, 635, 4468, 1328, 368, 8411, 47177, 1106, 2938, 419, 1197, 1776, 13, 50751], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 333, "seek": 163916, "start": 1647.5, "end": 1651.88, "text": " Simplemente hay una regla biol\u00f3gica min\u00fascula de escala y rotaci\u00f3n,", "tokens": [50782, 21532, 4082, 4842, 2002, 1121, 875, 3228, 27629, 2262, 923, 10227, 2444, 64, 368, 4721, 5159, 288, 4297, 3482, 11, 51001], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 334, "seek": 163916, "start": 1652.3200000000002, "end": 1654.0, "text": " un amplituist natural,", "tokens": [51023, 517, 9731, 6380, 468, 3303, 11, 51107], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 335, "seek": 163916, "start": 1654.5400000000002, "end": 1657.3200000000002, "text": " que se aplica sobre s\u00ed misma una y otra vez.", "tokens": [51134, 631, 369, 25522, 2262, 5473, 8600, 24946, 2002, 288, 13623, 5715, 13, 51273], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 336, "seek": 163916, "start": 1657.78, "end": 1661.0400000000002, "text": " Y a partir de esa regla que se regenera continuamente en el tiempo,", "tokens": [51296, 398, 257, 13906, 368, 11342, 1121, 875, 631, 369, 33909, 1663, 2993, 3439, 465, 806, 11772, 11, 51459], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 337, "seek": 163916, "start": 1661.6000000000001, "end": 1664.14, "text": " florece una forma incre\u00edblemente compleja.", "tokens": [51487, 932, 418, 384, 2002, 8366, 46202, 638, 4082, 44424, 2938, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 338, "seek": 163916, "start": 1664.4, "end": 1668.74, "text": " El balance al caminar no es una postura que logras y mantienes.", "tokens": [51627, 2699, 4772, 419, 1945, 6470, 572, 785, 2002, 2183, 2991, 631, 31013, 296, 288, 10845, 1053, 279, 13, 51844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08360651661367978, "compression_ratio": 1.5492957746478873, "no_speech_prob": 1.0794130346492015e-11}, {"id": 339, "seek": 166874, "start": 1668.74, "end": 1673.98, "text": " Es una historia que est\u00e1s regenerando ininterrumpidamente a cada milisegundo que pasa.", "tokens": [50365, 2313, 2002, 18385, 631, 24389, 26358, 1806, 294, 5106, 81, 1420, 49663, 257, 8411, 1962, 908, 70, 6043, 631, 20260, 13, 50627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 340, "seek": 166874, "start": 1674.18, "end": 1676.6200000000001, "text": " Es una imagen hermosa y muy precisa.", "tokens": [50637, 2313, 2002, 40652, 720, 3415, 64, 288, 5323, 18861, 13, 50759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 341, "seek": 166874, "start": 1677.4, "end": 1677.86, "text": " Pero mira,", "tokens": [50798, 9377, 30286, 11, 50821], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 342, "seek": 166874, "start": 1678.38, "end": 1681.48, "text": " lo que separa a esta investigaci\u00f3n t\u00e9cnica de la mera poes\u00eda", "tokens": [50847, 450, 631, 3128, 64, 257, 5283, 48919, 45411, 368, 635, 275, 1663, 714, 279, 2686, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 343, "seek": 166874, "start": 1681.48, "end": 1684.1200000000001, "text": " y lo que la convierte en ciencia de primer nivel", "tokens": [51002, 288, 450, 631, 635, 3754, 23123, 465, 269, 30592, 368, 12595, 24423, 51134], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 344, "seek": 166874, "start": 1684.1200000000001, "end": 1687.98, "text": " es que Flypexun establece reglas estrictas de falsabilidad.", "tokens": [51134, 785, 631, 25294, 29420, 409, 37444, 384, 1121, 7743, 871, 3740, 296, 368, 16720, 5177, 4580, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 345, "seek": 166874, "start": 1688.78, "end": 1692.06, "text": " Para que esta teor\u00eda geom\u00e9trica del amplituist sea dada por cierta,", "tokens": [51367, 11107, 631, 5283, 40238, 2686, 1519, 298, 4051, 15192, 1103, 9731, 6380, 468, 4158, 274, 1538, 1515, 39769, 1328, 11, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 346, "seek": 166874, "start": 1692.6, "end": 1694.94, "text": " el autor propone pruebas emp\u00edricas de laboratorio", "tokens": [51558, 806, 19510, 2365, 546, 32820, 16342, 4012, 870, 1341, 296, 368, 5938, 48028, 51675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11390548528626908, "compression_ratio": 1.5830258302583027, "no_speech_prob": 9.12538534320051e-12}, {"id": 347, "seek": 169494, "start": 1694.94, "end": 1696.9, "text": " que podr\u00edan destruirla por completo.", "tokens": [50365, 631, 15305, 11084, 34235, 347, 875, 1515, 40135, 13, 50463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 348, "seek": 169494, "start": 1697.38, "end": 1701.46, "text": " S\u00ed, esa es la prueba de fuego que me dej\u00f3 helada cuando estaba leyendo.", "tokens": [50487, 12375, 11, 11342, 785, 635, 48241, 368, 43934, 631, 385, 21259, 812, 801, 1538, 7767, 17544, 27786, 3999, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 349, "seek": 169494, "start": 1701.94, "end": 1704.88, "text": " El criterio de la ca\u00edda de coherencia lo llama.", "tokens": [50715, 2699, 9912, 1004, 368, 635, 1335, 39080, 368, 26528, 10974, 450, 23272, 13, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 350, "seek": 169494, "start": 1705.26, "end": 1705.8, "text": " As\u00ed es.", "tokens": [50881, 17419, 785, 13, 50908], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 351, "seek": 169494, "start": 1706.5, "end": 1710.18, "text": " La teor\u00eda predice que si el equilibrio no es una postura est\u00e1tica,", "tokens": [50943, 2369, 40238, 2686, 3852, 573, 631, 1511, 806, 14204, 6584, 572, 785, 2002, 2183, 2991, 3192, 83, 2262, 11, 51127], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 352, "seek": 169494, "start": 1710.76, "end": 1714.94, "text": " sino una sincronizaci\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica continua de estos osciladores nerviosos,", "tokens": [51156, 18108, 2002, 3343, 66, 2044, 27603, 3803, 443, 23432, 40861, 368, 12585, 3003, 3208, 11856, 5724, 2717, 329, 11, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 353, "seek": 169494, "start": 1715.5800000000002, "end": 1715.94, "text": " entonces,", "tokens": [51397, 13003, 11, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 354, "seek": 169494, "start": 1716.6000000000001, "end": 1720.94, "text": " mucho antes de que el cuerpo f\u00edsico de una persona muestre cualquier signo mec\u00e1nico de inestabilidad,", "tokens": [51448, 9824, 11014, 368, 631, 806, 20264, 27538, 2789, 368, 2002, 12184, 2992, 41135, 21004, 1465, 78, 25186, 7200, 2789, 368, 294, 377, 5177, 4580, 11, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13610344233475333, "compression_ratio": 1.5467625899280575, "no_speech_prob": 9.750900607785606e-12}, {"id": 355, "seek": 172094, "start": 1720.94, "end": 1722.38, "text": " o sea,", "tokens": [50365, 277, 4158, 11, 50437], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 356, "seek": 172094, "start": 1722.5, "end": 1725.64, "text": " mucho antes de que tropieces visiblemente y muevas los grasos.", "tokens": [50443, 9824, 11014, 368, 631, 9006, 414, 887, 8974, 4082, 288, 49532, 7967, 1750, 29444, 329, 13, 50600], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 357, "seek": 172094, "start": 1725.94, "end": 1726.28, "text": " Aj\u00e1.", "tokens": [50615, 25862, 842, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 358, "seek": 172094, "start": 1726.66, "end": 1729.46, "text": " La matem\u00e1tica interna tiene que fallar primero.", "tokens": [50651, 2369, 3803, 443, 23432, 728, 629, 7066, 631, 2100, 289, 21289, 13, 50791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 359, "seek": 172094, "start": 1729.88, "end": 1730.3200000000002, "text": " Exacto.", "tokens": [50812, 7199, 78, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 360, "seek": 172094, "start": 1730.66, "end": 1734.94, "text": " La coherencia medida de los osciladores debe caer precipitadamente en los datos.", "tokens": [50851, 2369, 26528, 10974, 32984, 368, 1750, 3003, 3208, 11856, 27422, 1335, 260, 23354, 270, 27858, 465, 1750, 27721, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 361, "seek": 172094, "start": 1735.48, "end": 1736.0, "text": " Y \u00e9l dice,", "tokens": [51092, 398, 11810, 10313, 11, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 362, "seek": 172094, "start": 1736.42, "end": 1738.88, "text": " si un grupo de cient\u00edficos en un laboratorio de marcha", "tokens": [51139, 1511, 517, 20190, 368, 37053, 329, 465, 517, 5938, 48028, 368, 8368, 64, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 363, "seek": 172094, "start": 1738.88, "end": 1741.6200000000001, "text": " le ponen sensores de electromiograf\u00eda a una persona,", "tokens": [51262, 476, 9224, 268, 2923, 2706, 368, 2185, 4397, 72, 19815, 2686, 257, 2002, 12184, 11, 51399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 364, "seek": 172094, "start": 1742.0800000000002, "end": 1743.64, "text": " la hacen tropezar intencionalmente,", "tokens": [51422, 635, 27434, 4495, 15144, 289, 560, 22660, 1966, 4082, 11, 51500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 365, "seek": 172094, "start": 1744.0, "end": 1748.02, "text": " y no logran detectar esa ca\u00edda invisible de coherencia en los datos milisegundos", "tokens": [51518, 288, 572, 31013, 282, 5531, 289, 11342, 1335, 39080, 14603, 368, 26528, 10974, 465, 1750, 27721, 1962, 908, 70, 36518, 51719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 366, "seek": 172094, "start": 1748.02, "end": 1749.52, "text": " antes del tropiezo f\u00edsico real,", "tokens": [51719, 11014, 1103, 9006, 414, 4765, 27538, 2789, 957, 11, 51794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12998893837523617, "compression_ratio": 1.6308724832214765, "no_speech_prob": 9.866667378954919e-12}, {"id": 367, "seek": 174952, "start": 1749.52, "end": 1750.8, "text": " Se acaba la teor\u00eda.", "tokens": [50365, 1100, 23485, 635, 40238, 2686, 13, 50429], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 368, "seek": 174952, "start": 1751.2, "end": 1754.84, "text": " S\u00ed, entonces toda la estructura te\u00f3lica del amplitudist y los osciladores", "tokens": [50449, 12375, 11, 13003, 11687, 635, 43935, 2991, 535, 812, 44266, 1103, 9731, 21875, 468, 288, 1750, 3003, 3208, 11856, 50631], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 369, "seek": 174952, "start": 1754.84, "end": 1756.92, "text": " se desploma y es falsa.", "tokens": [50631, 369, 730, 564, 6440, 288, 785, 16720, 64, 13, 50735], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 370, "seek": 174952, "start": 1757.42, "end": 1762.26, "text": " Pone su propia existencia y todo este documento monumental en la l\u00ednea de fuego.", "tokens": [50760, 430, 546, 459, 40464, 2514, 10974, 288, 5149, 4065, 4166, 78, 43105, 465, 635, 37452, 368, 43934, 13, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 371, "seek": 174952, "start": 1763.02, "end": 1767.0, "text": " Esa honestidad intelectual me parece brutal y refrescante.", "tokens": [51040, 2313, 64, 3245, 4580, 2830, 1809, 901, 385, 14120, 17878, 288, 17368, 66, 2879, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 372, "seek": 174952, "start": 1767.5, "end": 1773.6, "text": " Y es el broche de oro perfecto para recapitular el inmenso terreno conceptual que hemos cruzado hoy.", "tokens": [51264, 398, 785, 806, 2006, 1876, 368, 45150, 2176, 78, 1690, 20928, 270, 1040, 806, 294, 2558, 539, 1796, 48207, 24106, 631, 15396, 5140, 89, 1573, 13775, 13, 51569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 373, "seek": 174952, "start": 1773.9, "end": 1775.24, "text": " Porque vaya que fue un viaje.", "tokens": [51584, 11287, 47682, 631, 9248, 517, 48932, 13, 51651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 374, "seek": 174952, "start": 1775.66, "end": 1776.5, "text": " Vaya que s\u00ed.", "tokens": [51672, 691, 4427, 631, 8600, 13, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13186333256383095, "compression_ratio": 1.5320754716981133, "no_speech_prob": 1.1007595009104865e-11}, {"id": 375, "seek": 177650, "start": 1776.5, "end": 1781.72, "text": " Empezamos desenterrando los f\u00f3siles del c\u00f3digo en lenguajes como C++,", "tokens": [50365, 3968, 15144, 2151, 730, 14278, 19845, 1750, 283, 12994, 4680, 1103, 44195, 465, 35044, 84, 29362, 2617, 383, 25472, 11, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09957524467917049, "compression_ratio": 1.4951456310679612, "no_speech_prob": 1.1807620853288014e-11}, {"id": 376, "seek": 177650, "start": 1782.34, "end": 1786.82, "text": " sistemas que est\u00e1n literalmente atrapados por el miedo a borrar su propia historia.", "tokens": [50657, 48720, 631, 10368, 20411, 4082, 412, 4007, 4181, 1515, 806, 40383, 257, 14828, 5352, 459, 40464, 18385, 13, 50881], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09957524467917049, "compression_ratio": 1.4951456310679612, "no_speech_prob": 1.1807620853288014e-11}, {"id": 377, "seek": 177650, "start": 1787.56, "end": 1791.7, "text": " Luego analizamos c\u00f3mo el cerebro humano de los ajedrecistas y los mec\u00e1nicos", "tokens": [50918, 45665, 2624, 590, 2151, 12826, 806, 11643, 9120, 30985, 368, 1750, 17680, 292, 13867, 14858, 288, 1750, 25186, 7200, 9940, 51125], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09957524467917049, "compression_ratio": 1.4951456310679612, "no_speech_prob": 1.1807620853288014e-11}, {"id": 378, "seek": 177650, "start": 1791.7, "end": 1795.5, "text": " comprime los errores del pasado para tomar decisiones casi instant\u00e1neas,", "tokens": [51125, 16802, 1312, 1750, 45935, 495, 1103, 24794, 1690, 22048, 3537, 279, 22567, 9836, 842, 716, 296, 11, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09957524467917049, "compression_ratio": 1.4951456310679612, "no_speech_prob": 1.1807620853288014e-11}, {"id": 379, "seek": 179550, "start": 1795.5, "end": 1801.72, "text": " volvi\u00e9ndose rapid\u00edsimos pero peligrosamente fr\u00e1giles si las reglas del entorno cambian.", "tokens": [50365, 1996, 4917, 34577, 541, 7558, 5113, 8372, 4768, 43839, 2635, 3439, 431, 21099, 4680, 1511, 2439, 1121, 7743, 1103, 948, 21998, 18751, 952, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11322577456210522, "compression_ratio": 1.4792626728110598, "no_speech_prob": 1.2135812320346329e-11}, {"id": 380, "seek": 179550, "start": 1801.84, "end": 1802.5, "text": " El experto fr\u00e1gil.", "tokens": [50682, 2699, 1086, 1353, 431, 21099, 388, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11322577456210522, "compression_ratio": 1.4792626728110598, "no_speech_prob": 1.2135812320346329e-11}, {"id": 381, "seek": 179550, "start": 1803.22, "end": 1803.4, "text": " S\u00ed.", "tokens": [50751, 12375, 13, 50760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11322577456210522, "compression_ratio": 1.4792626728110598, "no_speech_prob": 1.2135812320346329e-11}, {"id": 382, "seek": 179550, "start": 1804.02, "end": 1808.5, "text": " Exploramos tambi\u00e9n la gesti\u00f3n del futuro y c\u00f3mo, al podar la informaci\u00f3n equivocada,", "tokens": [50791, 12514, 284, 2151, 6407, 635, 7219, 2560, 1103, 23953, 288, 12826, 11, 419, 2497, 289, 635, 21660, 48726, 905, 1538, 11, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11322577456210522, "compression_ratio": 1.4792626728110598, "no_speech_prob": 1.2135812320346329e-11}, {"id": 383, "seek": 179550, "start": 1809.5, "end": 1816.72, "text": " al comprimir mal la maleta, generamos d\u00e9ficits ontol\u00f3gicos tan graves que hunden experimentos cient\u00edficos enteros", "tokens": [51065, 419, 715, 5565, 347, 2806, 635, 2806, 7664, 11, 1337, 2151, 2795, 1786, 1208, 6592, 27629, 9940, 7603, 31664, 631, 276, 10028, 5120, 329, 37053, 329, 3242, 329, 51426], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11322577456210522, "compression_ratio": 1.4792626728110598, "no_speech_prob": 1.2135812320346329e-11}, {"id": 384, "seek": 181672, "start": 1816.72, "end": 1820.5, "text": " o dejan peatones virtuales atrapados en sem\u00e1foros ciegos.", "tokens": [50365, 277, 368, 14763, 520, 267, 2213, 6374, 279, 412, 4007, 4181, 465, 4361, 842, 2994, 329, 30596, 18674, 13, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1793675763266427, "compression_ratio": 0.9305555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 9.232786410406923e-12}, {"id": 385, "seek": 181672, "start": 1820.8600000000001, "end": 1821.42, "text": " As\u00ed es.", "tokens": [50572, 17419, 785, 13, 50600], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1793675763266427, "compression_ratio": 0.9305555555555556, "no_speech_prob": 9.232786410406923e-12}, {"id": 386, "seek": 182142, "start": 1821.42, "end": 1828.52, "text": " Desenmascaramos la ilusi\u00f3n matem\u00e1tica y burocr\u00e1tica de creer que tener 100 inspectores id\u00e9nticos evaluando un puente", "tokens": [50365, 3885, 268, 3799, 6166, 2151, 635, 1930, 301, 2560, 3803, 443, 23432, 288, 758, 340, 10757, 23432, 368, 1197, 260, 631, 11640, 2319, 15018, 2706, 4496, 37239, 9940, 6133, 1806, 517, 2362, 1576, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07627732483382077, "compression_ratio": 1.4680851063829787, "no_speech_prob": 9.414121392159469e-12}, {"id": 387, "seek": 182142, "start": 1828.52, "end": 1830.46, "text": " nos hace 100 veces m\u00e1s seguros.", "tokens": [50720, 3269, 10032, 2319, 17054, 3573, 3896, 8977, 13, 50817], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07627732483382077, "compression_ratio": 1.4680851063829787, "no_speech_prob": 9.414121392159469e-12}, {"id": 388, "seek": 182142, "start": 1831.0, "end": 1837.74, "text": " Y, finalmente, demostramos que algo tan mundano, tan tangible como caminar sobre dos piernas sin caernos,", "tokens": [50844, 398, 11, 35577, 11, 41556, 30227, 631, 8655, 7603, 23175, 3730, 11, 7603, 27094, 2617, 1945, 6470, 5473, 4491, 9766, 18979, 3343, 1335, 1248, 329, 11, 51181], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07627732483382077, "compression_ratio": 1.4680851063829787, "no_speech_prob": 9.414121392159469e-12}, {"id": 389, "seek": 182142, "start": 1838.14, "end": 1840.28, "text": " obedece exactamente al mismo principio.", "tokens": [51201, 1111, 4858, 384, 48686, 419, 12461, 34308, 13, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07627732483382077, "compression_ratio": 1.4680851063829787, "no_speech_prob": 9.414121392159469e-12}, {"id": 390, "seek": 182142, "start": 1840.7, "end": 1843.5, "text": " Somos historias regener\u00e1ndose en movimiento.", "tokens": [51329, 12297, 329, 4058, 4609, 26358, 18606, 541, 465, 43180, 13, 51469], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07627732483382077, "compression_ratio": 1.4680851063829787, "no_speech_prob": 9.414121392159469e-12}, {"id": 391, "seek": 184350, "start": 1843.5, "end": 1847.58, "text": " Y el hilo conductor en todos estos textos es innegable.", "tokens": [50365, 398, 806, 276, 10720, 29957, 465, 6321, 12585, 2487, 329, 785, 24170, 70, 712, 13, 50569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 392, "seek": 184350, "start": 1848.26, "end": 1853.1, "text": " Ya sea en la arquitectura base de un software, en la sinapsis del aprendizaje humano profundo,", "tokens": [50603, 6080, 4158, 465, 635, 40258, 5739, 2991, 3096, 368, 517, 4722, 11, 465, 635, 3343, 2382, 271, 1103, 21003, 590, 11153, 30985, 1740, 6043, 11, 50845], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 393, "seek": 184350, "start": 1853.44, "end": 1855.94, "text": " o en la biomec\u00e1nica de evitar una ca\u00edda en la calle,", "tokens": [50862, 277, 465, 635, 3228, 423, 66, 7200, 2262, 368, 31326, 2002, 1335, 39080, 465, 635, 45092, 11, 50987], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 394, "seek": 184350, "start": 1856.36, "end": 1860.0, "text": " el universo entero opera de forma mucho m\u00e1s robusta y elegante", "tokens": [51008, 806, 42332, 948, 2032, 22202, 368, 8366, 9824, 3573, 13956, 64, 288, 14459, 2879, 51190], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 395, "seek": 184350, "start": 1860.0, "end": 1864.4, "text": " cuando logramos soltar la necesidad humana de fotografiar estados fijos", "tokens": [51190, 7767, 450, 1342, 329, 1404, 23480, 635, 11909, 4580, 1952, 64, 368, 34341, 9448, 871, 4181, 42001, 329, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 396, "seek": 184350, "start": 1864.4, "end": 1867.98, "text": " y abrazamos la fluidez de las continuaciones y trayectorias.", "tokens": [51410, 288, 410, 30695, 2151, 635, 5029, 45170, 368, 2439, 2993, 9188, 288, 16027, 20814, 4609, 13, 51589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 397, "seek": 184350, "start": 1868.56, "end": 1869.16, "text": " Totalmente.", "tokens": [51618, 23170, 4082, 13, 51648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0837186997936618, "compression_ratio": 1.5862068965517242, "no_speech_prob": 1.0793706206602138e-11}, {"id": 398, "seek": 186916, "start": 1869.16, "end": 1876.16, "text": " La realidad, digamos en su forma m\u00e1s pura y natural, no es un estante lleno de cajas etiquetadas est\u00e1ticas.", "tokens": [50365, 2369, 25635, 11, 36430, 465, 459, 8366, 3573, 1864, 64, 288, 3303, 11, 572, 785, 517, 871, 2879, 4849, 5808, 368, 1335, 19221, 42177, 302, 6872, 3192, 83, 9150, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 399, "seek": 186916, "start": 1876.7, "end": 1879.0, "text": " Es un cauce fluido de futuros posibles.", "tokens": [50742, 2313, 517, 1335, 4176, 5029, 2925, 368, 1877, 8977, 1366, 14428, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 400, "seek": 186916, "start": 1879.28, "end": 1883.52, "text": " Y justo antes de despedirnos de esta inmersi\u00f3n profunda,", "tokens": [50871, 398, 40534, 11014, 368, 730, 3452, 347, 16751, 368, 5283, 294, 18552, 2560, 1740, 11946, 11, 51083], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 401, "seek": 186916, "start": 1884.0, "end": 1887.1200000000001, "text": " nos gustar\u00eda dejar sobre la mesa un pensamiento final para ustedes,", "tokens": [51107, 3269, 45896, 24391, 5473, 635, 37024, 517, 6099, 16971, 2572, 1690, 17110, 11, 51263], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 402, "seek": 186916, "start": 1887.66, "end": 1893.0, "text": " basado en todo este intrincado mecanismo de compresi\u00f3n y memoria que describi\u00f3 Flaicci\u00f3n,", "tokens": [51290, 987, 1573, 465, 5149, 4065, 17467, 4647, 1573, 385, 7035, 6882, 368, 715, 495, 2560, 288, 1334, 8172, 631, 2189, 5614, 812, 479, 875, 299, 5687, 11, 51557], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 403, "seek": 186916, "start": 1893.5600000000002, "end": 1898.5800000000002, "text": " pero enfocado hacia adentro, hacia la vida cotidiana y emocional.", "tokens": [51585, 4768, 10667, 21636, 21365, 614, 317, 340, 11, 21365, 635, 7644, 26529, 327, 8497, 288, 28283, 1966, 13, 51836], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10275890643780049, "compression_ratio": 1.5591397849462365, "no_speech_prob": 9.19703462692878e-12}, {"id": 404, "seek": 189858, "start": 1898.58, "end": 1905.46, "text": " Cuando la mente humana entierra o, digamos, olvida ciertos detalles agudos de un trauma del pasado", "tokens": [50365, 21907, 635, 26577, 1952, 64, 948, 17452, 277, 11, 36430, 11, 2545, 32500, 49252, 329, 1141, 37927, 623, 35063, 368, 517, 11407, 1103, 24794, 50709], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 405, "seek": 189858, "start": 1905.46, "end": 1910.1799999999998, "text": " o difumina los recuerdos de una relaci\u00f3n o un proyecto que fracas\u00f3,", "tokens": [50709, 277, 679, 449, 1426, 1750, 39092, 33749, 368, 2002, 37247, 277, 517, 32285, 631, 431, 43786, 812, 11, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 406, "seek": 189858, "start": 1910.74, "end": 1913.02, "text": " solemos pensar en ello como un error, \u00bfno?", "tokens": [50973, 12321, 3415, 18321, 465, 33549, 2617, 517, 6713, 11, 3841, 1771, 30, 51087], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 407, "seek": 189858, "start": 1913.4199999999998, "end": 1916.02, "text": " Como una aver\u00eda en nuestro disco duro emocional.", "tokens": [51107, 11913, 2002, 18247, 2686, 465, 14726, 3622, 1581, 340, 28283, 1966, 13, 51237], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 408, "seek": 189858, "start": 1916.58, "end": 1918.54, "text": " Claro, pensamos que la memoria nos falla.", "tokens": [51265, 33380, 11, 6099, 2151, 631, 635, 1334, 8172, 3269, 2100, 64, 13, 51363], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 409, "seek": 189858, "start": 1918.6399999999999, "end": 1921.8999999999999, "text": " Pero bajo esta \u00f3ptica geom\u00e9trica de los documentos de hoy,", "tokens": [51368, 9377, 30139, 5283, 11857, 662, 2262, 1519, 298, 4051, 15192, 368, 1750, 4166, 329, 368, 13775, 11, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 410, "seek": 189858, "start": 1922.34, "end": 1923.9199999999998, "text": " \u00bfqu\u00e9 tal si no es un fallo en lo absoluto?", "tokens": [51553, 3841, 16412, 4023, 1511, 572, 785, 517, 2100, 78, 465, 450, 18757, 78, 30, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09607756805419922, "compression_ratio": 1.5413533834586466, "no_speech_prob": 1.087835030388895e-11}, {"id": 411, "seek": 192392, "start": 1923.92, "end": 1926.7, "text": " \u00bfQu\u00e9 tal si es una compresi\u00f3n \u00f3ptima?", "tokens": [50365, 3841, 15137, 4023, 1511, 785, 2002, 715, 495, 2560, 11857, 662, 4775, 30, 50504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 412, "seek": 192392, "start": 1927.02, "end": 1930.64, "text": " Un mecanismo brillantemente dise\u00f1ado por nuestra biolog\u00eda", "tokens": [50520, 1156, 385, 7035, 6882, 8695, 394, 16288, 3814, 2791, 1573, 1515, 16825, 3228, 29987, 50701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 413, "seek": 192392, "start": 1930.64, "end": 1935.3400000000001, "text": " para desechar la entrop\u00eda de reparaci\u00f3n y preparar la mente,", "tokens": [50701, 1690, 730, 5023, 289, 635, 948, 1513, 2686, 368, 33291, 3482, 288, 8231, 289, 635, 26577, 11, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 414, "seek": 192392, "start": 1935.8400000000001, "end": 1939.8200000000002, "text": " optimiz\u00e1ndola para los futuros espec\u00edficos que el cerebro cree que va a enfrentar ma\u00f1ana.", "tokens": [50961, 5028, 590, 18606, 4711, 1690, 1750, 1877, 8977, 32741, 329, 631, 806, 11643, 9120, 48895, 631, 2773, 257, 33771, 289, 33573, 13, 51160], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 415, "seek": 192392, "start": 1940.0, "end": 1942.6000000000001, "text": " Uf, es una reflexi\u00f3n poderos\u00edsima.", "tokens": [51169, 624, 69, 11, 785, 2002, 23802, 2560, 8152, 329, 5113, 4775, 13, 51299], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 416, "seek": 192392, "start": 1943.0, "end": 1946.9, "text": " Y te digo, la sombra que persigue a esa misma idea es inevitable.", "tokens": [51319, 398, 535, 22990, 11, 635, 3307, 6198, 631, 868, 16831, 257, 11342, 24946, 1558, 785, 21451, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10298471713284833, "compression_ratio": 1.4634146341463414, "no_speech_prob": 8.705386238261337e-12}, {"id": 417, "seek": 194690, "start": 1946.9, "end": 1954.1200000000001, "text": " Si nuestra memoria est\u00e1 altame